s a outra."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoutez des scènes avec + sur une scène en cours de lecture ou avec le bouton de liste à regarder sur la page d'une scène. Elles sont lues ici l'une après l'autre."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voeg scènes toe met + bij een spelende scène of met de kijklijstknop op een scènepagina. Ze worden hier na elkaar afgespeeld."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أضف مشاهد باستخدام + على مشهد قيد التشغيل أو زر قائمة المشاهدة في صفحة المشهد. يتم تشغيلها هنا واحدًا تلو الآخر."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Füge Szenen mit + bei einer laufenden Szene oder mit der Merkliste-Taste auf einer Szenenseite hinzu. Sie werden hier nacheinander abgespielt."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Add scenes with + on a playing scene or the watchlist button on a scene page. They play here one after another."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在播放中的短片上點 +，或在短片頁面上點待看清單按鈕即可加入短片。它們會在這裡依序播放。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生中のシーンの＋、またはシーンページのウォッチリストボタンでシーンを追加できます。ここで順番に再生されます。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägg till scener med + på en scen som spelas eller med bevakningslisteknappen på en scensida. De spelas här efter varandra."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在正在播放的短片上点按 +，或在短片页面点按稍后观看按钮来添加短片。它们会在这里依次播放。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodawaj sceny przyciskiem + na odtwarzanej scenie lub przyciskiem Do obejrzenia na stronie sceny. Będą tu odtwarzane jedna po drugiej."}}}},"hint_adds_magazin_view_on_home":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adds a Magazin view on Home that shows your galleries as covers. They open like a magazine and remember the page you stopped on."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägger till en Magazin-vy på Hem som visar dina gallerier som omslag. De öppnas som en tidning och kommer ihåg sidan där du slutade."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legger til en Magazin-visning på Hjem som viser galleriene dine som omslag. De åpnes som et blad og husker siden du stoppet på."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يضيف عرض Magazin إلى الرئيسية يعرض معارضك كأغلفة. تُفتح مثل مجلة وتتذكر الصفحة التي توقفت عندها."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在首頁加入 Magazin 檢視，以封面顯示你的圖庫。它們會像雜誌一樣打開，並記住你上次停下的頁面。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoute à l'accueil une vue Magazin qui affiche vos galeries sous forme de couvertures. Elles s'ouvrent comme un magazine et se souviennent de la page où vous vous êtes arrêté."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ギャラリーを表紙として表示するMagazinビューをホームに追加します。雑誌のように開き、読み終えたページを記憶します。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adiciona ao Início uma visualização Magazin que mostra suas galerias como capas. Elas abrem como uma revista e lembram a página onde você parou."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voegt een Magazin-weergave toe op Home die je galerijen als omslagen toont. Ze openen als een tijdschrift en onthouden de pagina waar je bent gebleven."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tilføjer en Magazin-visning på Hjem, der viser dine gallerier som covers. De åbnes som et magasin og husker den side, du stoppede på."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodaje na ekranie Start widok Magazin, który pokazuje galerie jako okładki. Otwierają się jak czasopismo i pamiętają stronę, na której skończyłeś."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fügt auf Start eine Magazin-Ansicht hinzu, die deine Galerien als Cover zeigt. Sie öffnen sich wie ein Magazin und merken sich die Seite, auf der du aufgehört hast."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在主页添加 Magazin 视图，以封面形式显示你的图库。它们像杂志一样打开，并会记住你停留的页面。"}}}},"hint_add_stash_servers_and_switch":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoutez des serveurs Stash et passez de l'un à l'autre. Maintenez Sélectionner sur un serveur pour le modifier ou supprimer un serveur enregistré."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"新增 Stash 伺服器並在它們之間切換。在伺服器上按住「選擇」即可編輯或移除已儲存的伺服器。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tilføj Stash-servere, og skift mellem dem. Hold Vælg nede på en server for at redigere den eller fjerne en gemt server."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legg til Stash-servere og bytt mellom dem. Hold inne Velg på en server for å redigere den eller fjerne en lagret server."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashサーバーを追加して切り替えます。サーバー上で選択ボタンを長押しすると、編集や保存済みサーバーの削除ができます。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägg till Stash-servrar och växla mellan dem. Håll ned Välj på en server för att redigera den eller ta bort en sparad server."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Füge Stash-Server hinzu und wechsle zwischen ihnen. Halte Auswählen auf einem Server gedrückt, um ihn zu bearbeiten oder einen gespeicherten zu entfernen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adicione servidores Stash e alterne entre eles. Mantenha Selecionar pressionado em um servidor para editá-lo ou remover um salvo."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voeg Stash-servers toe en schakel ertussen. Houd Select ingedrukt op een server om hem te wijzigen of een bewaarde te verwijderen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"添加 Stash 服务器并在它们之间切换。在服务器上按住选择键可编辑或移除已存的服务器。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodawaj serwery Stash i przełączaj się między nimi. Przytrzymaj Wybierz na serwerze, aby go edytować lub usunąć zapisany."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Add Stash servers and switch between them. Hold Select on a server to edit it or remove a saved one."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أضف خوادم Stash وانتقل بينها. اضغط مطولًا على «تحديد» على خادم لتعديله أو إزالة خادم محفوظ."}}}},"hint_add_stash_servers_switch_between":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tilføj Stash-servere, skift mellem dem, og rediger eller fjern gemte servere."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أضف خوادم Stash وانتقل بينها، وعدّل الخوادم المحفوظة أو أزلها."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voeg Stash-servers toe, schakel ertussen en wijzig of verwijder bewaarde servers."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adicione servidores Stash, alterne entre eles e edite ou remova os salvos."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dodawaj serwery Stash, przełączaj się między nimi oraz edytuj lub usuwaj zapisane."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"新增 Stash 伺服器、在它們之間切換，以及編輯或移除已儲存的伺服器。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashサーバーを追加して切り替えたり、保存済みのサーバーを編集・削除したりできます。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legg til Stash-servere, bytt mellom dem, og rediger eller fjern lagrede servere."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"添加 Stash 服务器、在它们之间切换，并编辑或移除已存的服务器。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Add Stash servers, switch between them, and edit or remove saved ones."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ajoutez des serveurs Stash, passez de l'un à l'autre, et modifiez ou supprimez ceux enregistrés."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lägg till Stash-servrar, växla mellan dem och redigera eller ta bort sparade servrar."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Füge Stash-Server hinzu, wechsle zwischen ihnen und bearbeite oder entferne gespeicherte."}}}},"hint_ai_captions_are_part_of":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-bijschriften maken deel uit van stashy+"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI captions are part of stashy+"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"التسميات التوضيحية بالذكاء الاصطناعي جزء من stashy+"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-teksting er en del av stashy+"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+"}}}},"hint_ai_captions_are_part_of_stashy":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+ — 请在设置中解锁"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+ — odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+ – lås op i Indstillinger"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"التسميات التوضيحية بالذكاء الاصطناعي جزء من stashy+ — افتحها في الإعدادات"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+ — débloquez-les dans les réglages"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分 — 請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-teksting er en del av stashy+ – lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+ – lås upp i Inställningar"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+ — desbloqueie em Ajustes"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+ – in den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-bijschriften maken deel uit van stashy+ – ontgrendel in Instellingen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI captions are part of stashy+ — unlock in Settings"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}}}},"hint_ai_motion_is_part_of":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 属于 stashy+ — 请在设置中解锁"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion jest częścią stashy+ — odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion fait partie de stashy+ — débloquez-le dans les réglages"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion er en del av stashy+ – lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motionはstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion ingår i stashy+ – lås upp i Inställningar"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 是 stashy+ 的一部分 — 請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion er en del af stashy+ – lås op i Indstillinger"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O AI Motion faz parte do stashy+ — desbloqueie em Ajustes"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion is part of stashy+ — unlock in Settings"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion ist Teil von stashy+ – in den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion جزء من stashy+ — افتحه في الإعدادات"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion maakt deel uit van stashy+ – ontgrendel in Instellingen"}}}},"hint_ai_motion_uses_real_time":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion analizuje wideo w czasie rzeczywistym na urządzeniu, aby synchronizować Twoje urządzenia. Proces ten mocno obciąża procesor i może zwiększyć zużycie baterii oraz nagrzewanie urządzenia. Włączając tę funkcję, potwierdzasz, że korzystasz z AI Motion i wszelkich sterowanych urządzeń sprzętowych na własne ryzyko. Wyłączną odpowiedzialność za ewentualne szkody lub obrażenia wynikające z używania podłączonego sprzętu ponosisz Ty."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion gebruikt realtime videoanalyse op het apparaat om je apparaten te synchroniseren. Dit proces belast de CPU zwaar en kan leiden tot hoger batterijverbruik en opwarming van het apparaat. Door deze functie in te schakelen, erken je dat je AI Motion en alle aangestuurde hardware op eigen risico gebruikt. Eventuele schade of letsel door het gebruik van verbonden hardware is uitsluitend je eigen verantwoordelijkheid."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion nutzt Echtzeit-Videoanalyse auf dem Gerät, um deine Geräte zu synchronisieren. Das beansprucht die CPU stark und kann zu höherem Akkuverbrauch und Erwärmung des Geräts führen. Mit dem Aktivieren dieser Funktion bestätigst du, dass du AI Motion und alle gesteuerten Hardwaregeräte auf eigenes Risiko verwendest. Für mögliche Schäden oder Verletzungen durch die Nutzung verbundener Hardware bist allein du verantwortlich."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يستخدم AI Motion تحليل الفيديو في الوقت الفعلي على الجهاز لمزامنة أجهزتك. هذه العملية تستهلك المعالج بكثافة وقد تؤدي إلى زيادة استهلاك البطارية وارتفاع حرارة الجهاز. بتفعيل هذه الميزة، فإنك تقر بأنك تستخدم AI Motion وأي أجهزة يتم التحكم بها على مسؤوليتك الخاصة. أي ضرر أو إصابة محتملة ناتجة عن استخدام الأجهزة المتصلة هي مسؤوليتك وحدك."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O AI Motion usa análise de vídeo em tempo real no dispositivo para sincronizar seus dispositivos. Esse processo exige muito da CPU e pode aumentar o consumo de bateria e o aquecimento do dispositivo. Ao ativar este recurso, você reconhece que usa o AI Motion e quaisquer dispositivos de hardware controlados por sua conta e risco. Qualquer dano ou lesão decorrente do uso de hardware conectado é de sua exclusiva responsabilidade."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion analyse la vidéo en temps réel sur l'appareil pour synchroniser vos appareils. Ce processus sollicite fortement le processeur et peut augmenter la consommation de batterie et l'échauffement de l'appareil. En activant cette fonction, vous reconnaissez utiliser AI Motion et tout appareil contrôlé à vos propres risques. Tout dommage ou blessure pouvant résulter de l'utilisation du matériel connecté relève de votre seule responsabilité."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion bruger videoanalyse i realtid på enheden til at synkronisere dine enheder. Processen er CPU-krævende og kan øge batteriforbruget og få enheden til at blive varm. Ved at slå denne funktion til accepterer du, at du bruger AI Motion og alle styrede hardwareenheder på egen risiko. Enhver skade eller personskade som følge af brugen af tilsluttet hardware er alene dit ansvar."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 會在裝置上即時分析影片，以同步你的裝置。此過程會大量使用 CPU，可能導致耗電增加和裝置發熱。啟用此功能即表示你了解使用 AI Motion 及任何受控硬體裝置的風險需自行承擔。因使用已連接硬體而可能造成的任何損壞或傷害，均由你自行負責。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion 使用设备上的实时视频分析来同步你的设备。此过程会占用大量 CPU，可能导致耗电增加和设备发热。启用此功能即表示你确认使用 AI Motion 及任何受控硬件设备的风险由你自行承担。因使用已连接硬件而导致的任何潜在损坏或伤害均由你本人负责。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion uses real-time on-device video analysis to synchronize your devices. This process is CPU-intensive and can lead to increased battery drain and device heating. By enabling this feature, you acknowledge that you use AI Motion and any controlled hardware devices at your own risk. Any potential damage or injury resulting from the use of connected hardware is your sole responsibility."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion använder videoanalys i realtid på enheten för att synkronisera dina enheter. Processen kräver mycket CPU och kan leda till ökad batteriförbrukning och att enheten blir varm. Genom att aktivera funktionen bekräftar du att du använder AI Motion och all styrd hårdvara på egen risk. Eventuella skador på egendom eller person till följd av användning av ansluten hårdvara är helt ditt eget ansvar."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motion bruker videoanalyse i sanntid på enheten for å synkronisere enhetene dine. Prosessen krever mye CPU og kan føre til økt batteriforbruk og at enheten blir varm. Ved å slå på denne funksjonen bekrefter du at du bruker AI Motion og all styrt maskinvare på eget ansvar. Eventuell skade som følge av bruk av tilkoblet maskinvare er ditt eget ansvar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI Motionは、デバイス上でのリアルタイム動画解析を使用してデバイスを同期します。この処理はCPU負荷が高く、バッテリー消費の増加やデバイスの発熱につながる場合があります。この機能を有効にすることで、AI Motionおよび制御されるハードウェアデバイスを自己責任で使用することに同意したものとみなされます。接続されたハードウェアの使用によって生じる損害や怪我については、すべてご自身の責任となります。"}}}},"hint_ai_subtitles_are_part_of":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI subtitles are part of stashy+"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del av stashy+"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ترجمات الذكاء الاصطناعي جزء من stashy+"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-ondertiteling maakt deel uit van stashy+"}}}},"hint_ai_subtitles_are_part_of_stashy":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"KI-Untertitel sind Teil von stashy+ – in den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕是 stashy+ 的一部分 — 請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ترجمات الذكاء الاصطناعي جزء من stashy+ — افتحها في الإعدادات"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI subtitles are part of stashy+ — unlock in Settings"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI 字幕属于 stashy+ — 请在设置中解锁"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertexter ingår i stashy+ – lås upp i Inställningar"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sous-titres IA font partie de stashy+ — débloquez-les dans les réglages"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Napisy AI są częścią stashy+ — odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del av stashy+ – lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI字幕はstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-ondertiteling maakt deel uit van stashy+ – ontgrendel in Instellingen"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"AI-undertekster er en del af stashy+ – lås op i Indstillinger"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendas por IA fazem parte do stashy+ — desbloqueie em Ajustes"}}}},"hint_all_arg_already_have_rating":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie %@ mają już ocenę."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tous les %@ ont déjà une note."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ hebben al een beoordeling."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ haben bereits eine Bewertung."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla %@ har redan ett betyg."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ har allerede en bedømmelse."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有%@都已有評分。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有%@都已有评分。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All %@ already have a rating."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todos os %@ já têm uma avaliação."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ har allerede en vurdering."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"كل %@ لديها تقييم بالفعل."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"すべての%@にはすでに評価があります。"}}}},"hint_all_arg_recorded_o_entries":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"سيتم حذف كل إدخالات O المسجلة وعددها %@ وتواريخها نهائيًا من الخادم. لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ erfassten O-Einträge und ihre Daten werden auf dem Server endgültig gelöscht. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ registrerede O-poster og deres datoer slettes permanent på serveren. Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla %@ registrerade O-poster och deras datum raderas permanent på servern. Det går inte att ångra."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todos os %@ registros de O e suas datas serão apagados permanentemente no servidor. Não é possível desfazer."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All %@ recorded O entries and their dates are permanently deleted on the server. This cannot be undone."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全部 %@ 筆已記錄的 O 項目及其日期將從伺服器永久刪除。此動作無法還原。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les %@ entrées O enregistrées et leurs dates seront définitivement supprimées du serveur. Cette action est irréversible."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全部 %@ 条已记录的 O 及其日期将从服务器上永久删除。此操作无法撤销。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"記録された%@件のOとその日付がすべてサーバーから完全に削除されます。この操作は取り消せません。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie zapisane wpisy O (%@) wraz z datami zostaną trwale usunięte z serwera. Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ registrerte O-oppføringer og datoene deres slettes permanent på serveren. Dette kan ikke angres."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle %@ geregistreerde O-items en hun datums worden definitief verwijderd op de server. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}}}},"hint_all_conditions_below_must_be":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les conditions ci-dessous doivent être remplies."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle betingelser nedenfor skal være opfyldt."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Bedingungen unten müssen zutreffen."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يجب أن تتحقق جميع الشروط أدناه."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as condições abaixo devem ser verdadeiras."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"以下のすべての条件を満たす必要があります。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla villkor nedan måste vara uppfyllda."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"必须满足下方所有条件。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All conditions below must be true."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aan alle voorwaarden hieronder moet worden voldaan."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"須符合下方所有條件。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie poniższe warunki muszą być spełnione."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle betingelsene nedenfor må være oppfylt."}}}},"hint_all_home_rows_are_turned":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie wiersze ekranu Start są wyłączone"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All Home rows are turned off"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Home-rijen zijn uitgeschakeld"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle rækker på Hjem er slået fra"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as linhas do Início estão desativadas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les rangées de l'accueil sont désactivées"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle radene på Hjem er slått av"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla rader på Hem är avstängda"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有首頁列都已關閉"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"جميع صفوف الرئيسية متوقفة"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームのすべての行がオフになっています"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有主页行均已关闭"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Zeilen auf Start sind ausgeschaltet"}}}},"hint_allow_stashy_to_install_apps":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nاسمح لـ stashy بتثبيت التطبيقات مرة واحدة، ثم اضغط على «تثبيت» مجددًا."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nPermita uma vez que o stashy instale apps e toque em Instalar novamente."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nTillat stashy å installere apper én gang, og trykk deretter på Installer igjen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nErlaube stashy einmalig, Apps zu installieren, und tippe dann erneut auf Installieren."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nTillåt stashy att installera appar en gång och tryck sedan på Installera igen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nSta stashy eenmalig toe apps te installeren en tik dan opnieuw op Installeer."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nAutorisez une fois stashy à installer des apps, puis touchez à nouveau Installer."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nTillad stashy at installere apps én gang, og tryk derefter på Installer igen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nZezwól stashy jednorazowo na instalowanie aplikacji, a następnie stuknij ponownie Instaluj."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nstashyにアプリのインストールを一度許可してから、もう一度「インストール」をタップしてください。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\n請允許 stashy 安裝 App 一次，然後再點一下「安裝」。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\nAllow stashy to install apps once, then tap Install again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"\n\n请允许 stashy 安装 App 一次，然后再次轻点“安装”。"}}}},"hint_all_scenes_are_removed_from":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scènes worden van de kijklijst gehaald. Wat speelt, blijft spelen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"すべてのシーンがウォッチリストから取り除かれます。再生中のものはそのまま再生されます。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scener fjernes fra Se senere. Det som spilles, fortsetter å spilles."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都将从稍后观看中移除。正在播放的内容会继续播放。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toutes les scènes sont retirées de la liste à regarder. La lecture en cours continue."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla scener tas bort från bevakningslistan. Det som spelas fortsätter spela."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"所有短片都會從待看清單移除。正在播放的內容會繼續播放。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تُزال كل المشاهد من قائمة المشاهدة. ما يتم تشغيله يستمر في التشغيل."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"All scenes are removed from the watchlist. What plays keeps playing."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle Szenen werden aus der Merkliste entfernt. Was gerade läuft, läuft weiter."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wszystkie sceny zostaną usunięte z listy Do obejrzenia. To, co jest odtwarzane, będzie odtwarzane dalej."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as cenas serão removidas da lista para assistir. O que está sendo reproduzido continua."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle scener fjernes fra Se senere. Det, der afspilles, fortsætter."}}}},"hint_also_from_menu_below_card":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Auch über das ···-Menü unter einer Karte."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Também pelo menu ··· abaixo de um cartão."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"متاح أيضًا من قائمة ··· أسفل البطاقة."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Även från menyn ··· under ett kort."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Également via le menu ··· sous une carte."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"也可以從卡片下方的 ··· 選單操作。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"也可通过卡片下方的 ··· 菜单设置。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"カードの下の···メニューからも設定できます。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Również z menu ··· pod kartą."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ook via het ···-menu onder een kaart."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Også fra ···-menyen under et kort."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Also from the ··· menu below a card."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Også fra menuen ··· under et kort."}}}},"hint_analyzes_playing_video_live_on":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analizuje odtwarzane wideo na żywo na urządzeniu i porusza podłączonym sprzętem synchronicznie z nim. Mocno obciąża procesor i baterię."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserar videon som spelas direkt på enheten och rör din anslutna hårdvara i takt med den. Använder mycket CPU och batteri."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserer den afspillede video live på din enhed og bevæger din tilsluttede hardware i takt med den. Bruger meget CPU og batteri."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyseert de spelende video live op je apparaat en beweegt je verbonden hardware synchroon mee. Gebruikt veel CPU en batterij."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyse en direct la vidéo en cours sur votre appareil et fait bouger votre matériel connecté en synchronisation. Consomme beaucoup de processeur et de batterie."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyserer videoen som spilles direkte på enheten, og beveger den tilkoblede maskinvaren i takt med den. Bruker mye CPU og batteri."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你的裝置上即時分析正在播放的影片，並讓已連接的硬體同步動作。會大量使用 CPU 和電池。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生中の動画をデバイス上でリアルタイムに解析し、接続されたハードウェアを同期して動かします。CPUとバッテリーを多く消費します。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يحلل الفيديو قيد التشغيل مباشرةً على جهازك ويحرّك أجهزتك المتصلة بالتزامن معه. يستهلك الكثير من المعالج والبطارية."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Analyzes the playing video live on you