rver."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你的 Stash 服务器上创建新的短片过滤器。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你的 Stash 伺服器上建立新的短片篩選條件。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ينشئ فلتر مشاهد جديدًا على خادم Stash."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashサーバーに新しいシーンフィルターを作成します。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Crée un nouveau filtre de scènes sur votre serveur Stash."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Maakt een nieuw scènefilter aan op je Stash-server."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Creates a new scene filter on your Stash server."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Erstellt einen neuen Szenenfilter auf deinem Stash-Server."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cria um novo filtro de cenas no seu servidor Stash."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppretter et nytt scenefilter på Stash-serveren din."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tworzy nowy filtr scen na serwerze Stash."}}}},"hint_creates_subtitles_from_scenes_speech":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Opretter undertekster ud fra talen i en scene på din enhed og oversætter dem til dit undertekstsprog. Slå dem til i afspillerens menu AI-undertekster."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在设备上根据短片中的语音生成字幕，并将其翻译为你的字幕语言。可在播放器的“AI 字幕”菜单中打开。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你的裝置上依短片中的語音產生字幕，並翻譯為你的字幕語言。請在播放器的「AI 字幕」選單中開啟。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ينشئ ترجمات من كلام المشهد على جهازك ويترجمها إلى لغة الترجمة لديك. فعّلها من قائمة ترجمات الذكاء الاصطناعي في المشغّل."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンの音声からデバイス上で字幕を作成し、字幕の言語に翻訳します。プレーヤーの「AI字幕」メニューでオンにしてください。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lager undertekster fra talen i en scene på enheten din og oversetter dem til undertekstspråket ditt. Slå dem på i spillerens AI-undertekster-meny."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Maakt op je apparaat ondertitels van de spraak in een scène en vertaalt ze naar je ondertitelingstaal. Schakel ze in via het menu AI-ondertiteling van de speler."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cria legendas a partir da fala de uma cena no seu dispositivo e as traduz para o seu idioma de legenda. Ative-as no menu Legendas por IA do player."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Creates subtitles from a scene's speech on your device and translates them into your subtitle language. Turn them on in the player's AI Subtitles menu."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skapar undertexter från en scens tal på enheten och översätter dem till ditt undertextspråk. Slå på dem i spelarens meny AI-undertexter."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Erstellt Untertitel aus der Sprache einer Szene auf deinem Gerät und übersetzt sie in deine Untertitelsprache. Schalte sie im Player-Menü KI-Untertitel ein."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Crée sur votre appareil des sous-titres à partir des dialogues d'une scène et les traduit dans votre langue de sous-titres. Activez-les dans le menu Sous-titres IA du lecteur."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tworzy na urządzeniu napisy z mowy w scenie i tłumaczy je na język napisów. Włącz je w menu Napisy AI odtwarzacza."}}}},"hint_current_video_frame_will_replace":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'image vidéo actuelle remplacera la couverture de cette scène. Cette action ne peut pas être annulée depuis l'app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Det aktuelle videobillede erstatter scenens coverbillede. Det kan ikke fortrydes fra appen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Het huidige videoframe vervangt de omslagafbeelding van deze scène. Dit kan niet in de app ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"سيحل إطار الفيديو الحالي محل صورة غلاف هذا المشهد. لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك من التطبيق."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O quadro atual do vídeo substituirá a imagem de capa desta cena. Isso não pode ser desfeito pelo app."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den aktuella bildrutan ersätter scenens omslagsbild. Det går inte att ångra i appen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den nåværende bilderuten erstatter omslagsbildet til denne scenen. Dette kan ikke angres fra appen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"現在の動画フレームでこのシーンのカバー画像を置き換えます。この操作はAppでは取り消せません。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Das aktuelle Videobild ersetzt das Coverbild dieser Szene. Das kann in der App nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bieżąca klatka wideo zastąpi obraz okładki tej sceny. Nie można tego cofnąć z poziomu aplikacji."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"目前的影片畫面將取代此短片的封面圖片。此動作無法從 App 中還原。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"当前视频帧将替换此短片的封面图片。此操作无法在 App 中撤销。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The current video frame will replace this scene’s cover image. This cannot be undone from the app."}}}},"hint_custom_app_icons_are_part":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Brugerdefinerede appikoner er en del af stashy+. Lås op i Indstillinger"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les icônes d'app personnalisées font partie de stashy+. Débloquez-les dans les réglages"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أيقونات التطبيق المخصصة جزء من stashy+. افتحها في الإعدادات"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Anpassade appsymboler ingår i stashy+. Lås upp i Inställningar"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"自訂 App 圖像是 stashy+ 的一部分。請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Własne ikony aplikacji są częścią stashy+. Odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aangepaste appsymbolen maken deel uit van stashy+. Ontgrendel in Instellingen"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"カスタムAppアイコンはstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Custom app icons are part of stashy+. Unlock in Settings"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ícones de app personalizados fazem parte do stashy+. Desbloqueie em Ajustes"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"自定 App 图标属于 stashy+。请在设置中解锁"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Egendefinerte appikoner er en del av stashy+. Lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Eigene App-Icons sind Teil von stashy+. In den Einstellungen freischalten"}}}},"hint_delete_arg_this_cannot_be":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Radera ”%@”? Det går inte att ångra."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Apagar '%@'? Não é possível desfazer."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć „%@”? Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delete '%@'? This cannot be undone."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprimer « %@ » ? Cette action est irréversible."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要刪除「%@」嗎？此動作無法還原。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」を削除しますか？この操作は取り消せません。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slet '%@'? Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"حذف '%@'؟ لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"'%@' verwijderen? Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要删除“%@”吗？此操作无法撤销。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"'%@' löschen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slette «%@»? Dette kan ikke angres."}}}},"hint_deletes_covers_previews_sprites_transcodes":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Raderar omslag, förhandsvisningar, sprites, omkodningar, markörfiler och miniatyrer som inte längre hör till något i databasen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deletes covers, previews, sprites, transcodes, marker files and thumbnails that no longer belong to anything in the database."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa okładki, podglądy, sprite'y, transkodowania, pliki znaczników i miniatury, które nie należą już do niczego w bazie danych."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"データベース内のどの項目にも属さなくなったカバー、プレビュー、スプライト、トランスコード、マーカーファイル、サムネイルを削除します。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يحذف الأغلفة والمعاينات والرسومات المجمّعة والملفات المحوّلة وملفات العلامات والصور المصغرة التي لم تعد تنتمي إلى أي شيء في قاعدة البيانات."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Apaga capas, pré-visualizações, sprites, transcodificações, arquivos de marcadores e miniaturas que não pertencem mais a nada no banco de dados."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Löscht Cover, Vorschauen, Sprites, Transcodes, Markerdateien und Thumbnails, die zu nichts mehr in der Datenbank gehören."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"删除不再属于数据库中任何内容的封面、预览、雪碧图、转码文件、标记文件和缩略图。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les couvertures, aperçus, sprites, transcodages, fichiers de marqueurs et vignettes qui n'appartiennent plus à rien dans la base de données."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert omslagen, voorvertoningen, sprites, transcodes, markeringsbestanden en miniaturen die niet meer bij iets in de database horen."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sletter covers, forhåndsvisninger, sprites, omkodninger, markørfiler og miniaturer, der ikke længere hører til noget i databasen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sletter omslag, forhåndsvisninger, sprites, transkodinger, markørfiler og miniatyrbilder som ikke lenger hører til noe i databasen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"刪除不再屬於資料庫中任何項目的封面、預覽、拼貼圖、轉檔、標記檔案和縮圖。"}}}},"hint_deletes_this_item_and_its":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sletter dette elementet og filene etter bekreftelse"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa ten element i jego pliki po potwierdzeniu"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert dit item en de bestanden ervan na bevestiging"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"確認後刪除此項目及其檔案"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"确认后删除此项目及其文件"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يحذف هذا العنصر وملفاته بعد التأكيد"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"確認後、この項目とそのファイルを削除します"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sletter dette element og dets filer efter bekræftelse"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deletes this item and its files after confirmation"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Apaga este item e seus arquivos após confirmação"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Raderar objektet och dess filer efter bekräftelse"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Löscht diesen Eintrag und seine Dateien nach Bestätigung"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime cet élément et ses fichiers après confirmation"}}}},"hint_double_tap_jumps_to_markers":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dubbeltik springt naar markeringen: in Feeds › Scènes gaat een dubbeltik links of rechts naar de vorige of volgende markering van een scène met markeringen. Zonder markering in die richting worden zoals gewoonlijk seconden overgeslagen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le double toucher passe aux marqueurs : dans Feeds › Scènes, un double toucher à gauche ou à droite passe au marqueur précédent ou suivant d'une scène qui en possède. Sans marqueur dans cette direction, il avance ou recule de quelques secondes comme d'habitude."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toque duplo pula para marcadores: em Feeds › Cenas, um toque duplo à esquerda ou à direita vai para o marcador anterior ou seguinte de uma cena que tenha marcadores. Sem marcador nessa direção, pula segundos como de costume."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"النقر المزدوج ينتقل إلى العلامات: في Feeds › المشاهد، يؤدي النقر المزدوج على اليسار أو اليمين إلى الانتقال إلى العلامة السابقة أو التالية لمشهد يحتوي على علامات. إذا لم توجد علامة في ذلك الاتجاه، يتخطى الثواني كالمعتاد."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Doppeltippen springt zu Markern: In Feeds › Szenen springt ein Doppeltippen links oder rechts zum vorherigen oder nächsten Marker einer Szene mit Markern. Gibt es in dieser Richtung keinen Marker, werden wie gewohnt Sekunden übersprungen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダブルタップでマーカーへ移動：Feeds › シーンで、マーカーのあるシーンの左または右をダブルタップすると、前または次のマーカーへ移動します。その方向にマーカーがない場合は、通常どおり秒単位でスキップします。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dobbelttrykk hopper til markører: I Feeds › Scener går et dobbelttrykk til venstre eller høyre til forrige eller neste markør i en scene som har markører. Uten en markør i den retningen hopper det sekunder som vanlig."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"轻点两下跳转到标记：在 Feeds › 短片中，对有标记的短片在左侧或右侧轻点两下，会跳到上一个或下一个标记。若该方向没有标记，则照常快进或快退数秒。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Double tap jumps to markers: in Feeds › Scenes a double tap on the left or right goes to the previous or next marker of a scene that has markers. Without a marker in that direction it skips seconds as usual."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dwukrotne stuknięcie skacze do znaczników: w Feeds › Sceny dwukrotne stuknięcie po lewej lub prawej przechodzi do poprzedniego lub następnego znacznika sceny, która ma znaczniki. Gdy w tym kierunku nie ma znacznika, przewija jak zwykle o sekundy."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"點兩下跳至標記：在 Feeds › 短片中，於左側或右側點兩下，即可跳至有標記之短片的上一個或下一個標記。若該方向沒有標記，則照常跳轉秒數。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dubbeltryck hoppar till markörer: i Feeds › Scener går ett dubbeltryck till vänster eller höger till föregående eller nästa markör i en scen som har markörer. Utan markör åt det hållet hoppar det sekunder som vanligt."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dobbelttryk springer til markører: I Feeds › Scener går et dobbelttryk til venstre eller højre til forrige eller næste markør i en scene, der har markører. Uden en markør i den retning springes sekunder over som normalt."}}}},"hint_download_arg_speech_model_to":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lade das Sprachmodell %@, um Live-Untertitel zu aktivieren."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Download the %@ speech model to enable live captions."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下載%@語音模型以啟用即時字幕。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Download talemodellen til %@ for at slå live-undertekster til."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Download het spraakmodel %@ om live bijschriften in te schakelen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下载%@语音模型以启用实时字幕。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ladda ner talmodellen för %@ för att aktivera liveundertexter."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Baixe o modelo de fala %@ para ativar legendas ao vivo."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"نزّل نموذج الكلام %@ لتفعيل التسميات التوضيحية المباشرة."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Last ned talemodellen for %@ for å slå på direkteteksting."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ライブ字幕を有効にするには、%@の音声モデルをダウンロードしてください。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobierz model mowy %@, aby włączyć napisy na żywo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Téléchargez le modèle vocal %@ pour activer les sous-titres en direct."}}}},"hint_downloaded_file_is_not_valid":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die geladene Datei ist kein gültiges App-Paket."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O arquivo baixado não é um pacote de app válido."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den downloadede fil er ikke en gyldig apppakke."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The downloaded file is not a valid app package."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下載的檔案不是有效的 App 套件。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"الملف الذي تم تنزيله ليس حزمة تطبيق صالحة."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den nedladdade filen är inte ett giltigt app-paket."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Het gedownloade bestand is geen geldig app-pakket."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロードしたファイルは有効なアプリパッケージではありません。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den nedlastede filen er ikke en gyldig apppakke."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下载的文件不是有效的 App 安装包。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le fichier téléchargé n'est pas un paquet d'app valide."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobrany plik nie jest prawidłowym pakietem aplikacji."}}}},"hint_downloaded_images_are_removed_from":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロードした画像はこのデバイスから取り除かれます。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De gedownloade afbeeldingen worden van dit apparaat verwijderd."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobrane obrazy zostaną usunięte z tego urządzenia."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The downloaded images are removed from this device."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De nedlastede bildene fjernes fra denne enheten."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les images téléchargées sont retirées de cet appareil."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De downloadede billeder fjernes fra denne enhed."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die geladenen Bilder werden von diesem Gerät entfernt."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"As imagens baixadas serão removidas deste dispositivo."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تُزال الصور التي تم تنزيلها من هذا الجهاز."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De nedladdade bilderna tas bort från den här enheten."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已下載的圖片將從此裝置移除。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已下载的图片将从此设备中移除。"}}}},"hint_downloaded_scenes_will_appear_here":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ستظهر المشاهد التي تم تنزيلها هنا للمشاهدة دون اتصال."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nedlastede scener vises her for visning uten nett."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロードしたシーンはここに表示され、オフラインで視聴できます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloadede scener vises her til offlinevisning."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloaded scenes will appear here for offline viewing."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nedladdade scener visas här för visning offline."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已下载的短片会显示在这里，供离线观看。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"As cenas baixadas aparecerão aqui para assistir offline."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les scènes téléchargées apparaîtront ici pour un visionnage hors ligne."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gedownloade scènes verschijnen hier om offline te bekijken."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已下載的短片會顯示在這裡，供離線觀看。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Geladene Szenen erscheinen hier zum Offline-Ansehen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobrane sceny pojawią się tutaj do oglądania offline."}}}},"hint_downloading_arg_speech_model_arg":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sprachmodell %@ wird geladen… %@ %%"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spraakmodel %@ downloaden… %@ %%"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Téléchargement du modèle vocal %@… %@ %%"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Baixando modelo de fala %@… %@ %%"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloader talemodel til %@… %@ %%"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"جارٍ تنزيل نموذج الكلام %@… %@ %%"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Laster ned talemodell for %@… %@ %%"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobieranie modelu mowy %@… %@ %%"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"%@の音声モデルをダウンロード中… %@ %%"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Laddar ner talmodell för %@… %@ %%"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在下載%@語音模型… %@ %%"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloading %@ speech model… %@ %%"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在下载%@语音模型… %@ %%"}}}},"hint_download_is_managed_by_ios":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nedladdningen hanteras av iOS och kan vara flera hundra megabyte."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Download wird von iOS verwaltet und kann mehrere hundert Megabyte groß sein."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يدير iOS التنزيل وقد يبلغ حجمه عدة مئات من الميغابايت."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nedlastingen håndteres av iOS og kan være på flere hundre megabyte."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O download é gerenciado pelo iOS e pode ter várias centenas de megabytes."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下载由 iOS 管理，可能有数百 MB。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloaden styres af iOS og kan fylde flere hundrede megabyte."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De download wordt door iOS beheerd en kan enkele honderden megabytes groot zijn."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The download is managed by iOS and can be several hundred megabytes."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobieraniem zarządza iOS, a plik może mieć kilkaset megabajtów."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下載由 iOS 管理，大小可能達數百 MB。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le téléchargement est géré par iOS et peut atteindre plusieurs centaines de mégaoctets."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロードはiOSによって管理され、数百MBになる場合があります。"}}}},"hint_downloads_are_part_of_stashy":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nedlastinger er en del av stashy+ – lås opp i Innstillinger"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下载功能属于 stashy+ — 请在设置中解锁"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloads sind Teil von stashy+ – in den Einstellungen freischalten"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"التنزيلات جزء من stashy+ — افتحها في الإعدادات"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloads er en del af stashy+ – lås op i Indstillinger"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloads fazem parte do stashy+ — desbloqueie em Ajustes"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下載功能是 stashy+ 的一部分 — 請在「設定」中解鎖"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloads are part of stashy+ — unlock in Settings"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nedladdningar ingår i stashy+ – lås upp i Inställningar"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloads maken deel uit van stashy+ – ontgrendel in Instellingen"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les téléchargements font partie de stashy+ — débloquez-les dans les réglages"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobieranie jest częścią stashy+ — odblokuj w Ustawieniach"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロードはstashy+の機能です。設定でロックを解除してください"}}}},"hint_downloads_newest_scenes_or_all":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloader de nyeste scener eller dem alle"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"最新のシーン、またはすべてのシーンをダウンロードします"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ينزّل أحدث المشاهد أو جميعها"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Laster ned de nyeste scenene, eller alle"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloads the newest scenes, or all of them"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Downloadt de nieuwste scènes, of allemaal"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Télécharge les scènes les plus récentes, ou toutes"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Baixa as cenas mais recentes ou todas"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下載最新的短片，或全部短片"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Laddar ner de senaste scenerna, eller alla"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下载最新的短片或全部短片"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobiera najnowsze sceny lub wszystkie"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lädt die neuesten Szenen oder alle"}}}},"hint_drag_to_reorder_cards_below":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"拖移以重新排列影片播放器下方的卡片；關閉卡片即可隱藏。橫向時，群組和標籤相鄰時會共用一列。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Faites glisser pour réordonner les cartes sous le lecteur vidéo ; désactivez une carte pour la masquer. En paysage, Groupes et Étiquettes partagent une rangée lorsqu'ils se suivent."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Przeciągnij, aby zmienić kolejność kart pod odtwarzaczem; wyłącz kartę, aby ją ukryć. W poziomie Grupy i Tagi dzielą wiersz, gdy sąsiadują ze sobą."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dra for å endre rekkefølgen på kortene under videospilleren; slå av et kort for å skjule det. I liggende format deler Grupper og Tagger en rad når de står ved siden av hverandre."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Drag to reorder the cards below the video player; switch a card off to hide it. In landscape, Groups and Tags share a row when they sit next to each other."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ドラッグして動画プレーヤーの下のカードを並べ替えます。カードをオフにすると非表示になります。横向きでは、グループとタグが隣り合っている場合に1行を共有します。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Arraste para reordenar os cartões abaixo do player de vídeo; desative um cartão para ocultá-lo. Na horizontal, Grupos e Etiquetas dividem uma linha quando estão um ao lado do outro."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dra för att ändra ordning på korten under videospelaren; stäng av ett kort för att dölja det. I liggande läge delar Grupper och Taggar en rad när de ligger bredvid varandra."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sleep om de kaarten onder de videospeler te ordenen; schakel een kaart uit om hem te verbergen. In liggende stand delen Groepen en Labels een rij als ze naast elkaar staan."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ziehe die Karten unter dem Videoplayer, um sie neu anzuordnen; schalte eine Karte aus, um sie auszublenden. Im Querformat teilen sich Gruppen und Tags eine Zeile, wenn sie nebeneinander liegen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"拖移以重新排列视频播放器下方的卡片；关闭某张卡片即可隐藏它。横排时，集合和标签相邻时会共用一行。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اسحب لإعادة ترتيب البطاقات أسفل مشغّل الفيديو؛ أوقف بطاقة لإخفائها. في الوضع الأفقي، تتشارك المجموعات والوسوم صفًا واحدًا عندما تكون متجاورة."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Træk for at ændre rækkefølgen af kortene under videoafspilleren; slå et kort fra for at skjule det. I liggende format deler Grupper og Tags en række, når de står ved siden af hinanden."}}}},"hint_drag_to_reorder_cards_below_video":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ドラッグして動画プレーヤーの下のカードを並べ替えます。カードをオフにすると非表示になります。横向きでは、グループとタグが隣り合っている場合に横に並びます。表示する内容がないカードはどちらの場合も非表示のままです。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sleep om de kaarten onder de videospeler te ordenen; schakel een kaart uit om hem te verbergen. In liggende stand staan Groepen en Labels naast elkaar als ze op elkaar volgen. Kaarten zonder inhoud blijven hoe dan ook verborgen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"拖移以重新排列影片播放器下方的卡片；關閉卡片即可隱藏。橫向時，群組和標籤相鄰時會並排顯示。沒有內容可顯示的卡片無論如何都會隱藏。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"拖移以重新排列视频播放器下方的卡片；关闭某张卡片即可隐藏它。横排时，集合和标签相邻时会并排显示。没有内容可显示的卡片始终隐藏。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dra för att ändra ordning på korten under videospelaren; stäng av ett kort för att dölja det. I liggande läge visas Grupper och Taggar sida vid sida när de ligger bredvid varandra. Kort som inte har något att visa förblir dolda ändå."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Træk for at ændre rækkefølgen af kortene under videoafspilleren; slå et kort fra for at skjule det. I liggende format står Grupper og Tags side om side, når de står ved siden af hinanden. Kort uden indhold forbliver skjult under alle omstændigheder."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dra for å endre rekkefølgen på kortene under videospilleren; slå av et kort for å skjule det. I liggende format står Grupper og Tagger side om side når de er ved siden av hverandre. Kort som ikke har noe å vise, forblir skjult uansett."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Faites glisser pour réordonner les cartes sous le lecteur vidéo ; désactivez une carte pour la masquer. En paysage, Groupes et Étiquettes se placent côte à côte lorsqu'ils se suivent. Les cartes sans contenu restent masquées dans tous les cas."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Przeciągnij, aby zmienić kolejność kart pod odtwarzaczem; wyłącz kartę, aby ją ukryć. W poziomie Grupy i Tagi są obok siebie, gdy sąsiadują ze sobą. Karty, które nie mają nic do pokazania, i tak pozostają ukryte."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Arraste para reordenar os cartões abaixo do player de vídeo; desative um cartão para ocultá-lo. Na horizontal, Grupos e Etiquetas ficam lado a lado quando estão um ao lado do outro. Cartões sem nada para mostrar ficam ocultos de qualquer forma."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ziehe die Karten unter dem Videoplayer, um sie neu anzuordnen; schalte eine Karte aus, um sie auszublenden. Im Querformat stehen Gruppen und Tags nebeneinander, wenn sie aufeinander folgen. Karten ohne Inhalt bleiben in jedem Fall ausgeblendet."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اسحب لإعادة ترتيب البطاقات أسفل مشغّل الفيديو؛ أوقف بطاقة لإخفائها. في الوضع الأفقي، تظهر المجموعات والوسوم جنبًا إلى جنب عندما تكون متجاورة. البطاقات التي لا تحتوي على شيء لعرضه تبقى مخفية في كل الأحوال."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Drag to reorder the cards below the video player; switch a card off to hide it. In landscape, Groups and Tags sit side by side when they are next to each other. Cards that have nothing to show stay hidden either way."}}}},"hint_dynamically_linked_so_library_can":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamiskt länkat, så biblioteket kan ersättas med en modifierad version."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"动态链接，因此该库可被替换为修改后的版本。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamically linked, so the library can be replaced by a modified version."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Liée dynamiquement, la bibliothèque peut donc être remplacée par une version modifiée."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisk linket, så biblioteket kan erstattes af en ændret version."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisch gekoppeld, zodat de bibliotheek door een aangepaste versie kan worden vervangen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"動的リンクのため、ライブラリを改変版に置き換えることができます。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vinculada dinamicamente, então a biblioteca pode ser substituída por uma versão modificada."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مرتبطة ديناميكيًا، لذا يمكن استبدال المكتبة بنسخة معدّلة."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Łączona dynamicznie, więc bibliotekę można zastąpić zmodyfikowaną wersją."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisch gelinkt, daher kann die Bibliothek durch eine veränderte Version ersetzt werden."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"採用動態連結，因此可將函式庫替換為修改後的版本。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisk lenket, slik at biblioteket kan erstattes med en endret versjon."}}}},"hint_dynamically_linked_so_relinking_with":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisk lenket, slik at det er mulig å lenke på nytt med en endret FFmpeg."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vinculado dinamicamente, então é possível revincular com um FFmpeg modificado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisch gelinkt, daher ist ein Neulinken mit einem veränderten FFmpeg möglich."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Łączona dynamicznie, więc możliwe jest ponowne połączenie ze zmodyfikowanym FFmpeg."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Liée dynamiquement, une nouvelle liaison avec un FFmpeg modifié est donc possible."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"採用動態連結，因此可與修改後的 FFmpeg 重新連結。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مرتبطة ديناميكيًا، لذا يمكن إعادة الربط بنسخة معدّلة من FFmpeg."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamiskt länkat, så det går att länka om med en modifierad FFmpeg."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisk linket, så det er muligt at linke igen med en ændret FFmpeg."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"动态链接，因此可以与修改后的 FFmpeg 重新链接。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"動的リンクのため、改変したFFmpegと再リンクできます。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamically linked, so relinking with a modified FFmpeg is possible."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dynamisch gekoppeld, zodat opnieuw koppelen met een aangepaste FFmpeg mogelijk is."}}}},"hint_each_job_downloads_its_configured":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Chaque tâche télécharge le nombre configuré d'éléments les plus récents. Les éléments déjà téléchargés sont ignorés."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hver jobb laster ned det konfigurerte antallet nyeste elementer. Elementer som allerede er lastet ned, hoppes over."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cada tarefa baixa o número configurado de itens mais recentes. Itens já baixados são pulados."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"每个任务会下载其所设数量的最新项目。已下载的项目将被跳过。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvert job downloader det konfigurerede antal nyeste elementer. Elementer, der allerede er downloadet, springes over."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jeder Job lädt die eingestellte Anzahl der neuesten Einträge. Bereits geladene Einträge werden übersprungen."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تنزّل كل مهمة العدد المحدد لها من أحدث العناصر. يتم تخطي العناصر التي تم تنزيلها بالفعل."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"各ジョブは設定された数の最新項目をダウンロードします。ダウンロード済みの項目はスキップされます。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Varje jobb laddar ner sitt inställda antal av de senaste objekten. Redan nedladdade objekt hoppas över."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Każde zadanie pobiera skonfigurowaną liczbę najnowszych elementów. Elementy już pobrane są pomijane."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"每個工作會下載其設定數量的最新項目。已下載的項目會略過。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Each job downloads its configured number of newest items. Items already downloaded are skipped."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elke taak downloadt het ingestelde aantal nieuwste items. Al gedownloade items worden overgeslagen."}}}},"hint_enter_address_e_g_timeout":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Indtast adresse (f.eks. timeout.com:9999 eller example.com/stash)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Digite o endereço (ex.: timeout.com:9999 ou example.com/stash)"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skriv inn adresse (f.eks. timeout.com:9999 eller example.com/stash)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アドレスを入力（例：timeout.com:9999 または example.com/stash）"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Saisissez l'adresse (p. ex. timeout.com:9999 ou example.com/stash)"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enter address (e.g. timeout.com:9999 or example.com/stash)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Adresse eingeben (z. B. timeout.com:9999 oder example.com/stash)"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أدخل العنوان (مثل timeout.com:9999 أو example.com/stash)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"输入地址（例如 timeout.com:9999 或 example.com/stash）"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wpisz adres (np. timeout.com:9999 lub example.com/stash)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ange adress (t.ex. timeout.com:9999 eller example.com/stash)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voer adres in (bijv. timeout.com:9999 of example.com/stash)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"輸入位址（例如 timeout.com:9999 或 example.com/stash）"}}}},"hint_enter_valid_date_as_yyyy":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skriv inn en gyldig dato som ÅÅÅÅ-MM-DD"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أدخل تاريخًا صالحًا بصيغة YYYY-MM-DD"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enter a valid date as YYYY-MM-DD"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請以 YYYY-MM-DD 格式輸入有效日期"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Indtast en gyldig dato som ÅÅÅÅ-MM-DD"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ange ett giltigt datum som ÅÅÅÅ-MM-DD"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wpisz prawidłową datę w formacie RRRR-MM-DD"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Digite uma data válida no formato AAAA-MM-DD"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Saisissez une date valide au format AAAA-MM-JJ"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voer een geldige datum in als JJJJ-MM-DD"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请输入有效日期，格式为 YYYY-MM-DD"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"有効な日付をYYYY-MM-DD形式で入力してください"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gib ein gültiges Datum als JJJJ-MM-TT ein"}}}},"hint_enter_your_stash_api_key":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"直接输入你的 Stash API 密钥。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Indtast din Stash-API-nøgle direkte."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ange din Stash-API-nyckel direkt."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أدخل مفتاح Stash API مباشرةً."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enter your Stash API key directly."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voer je Stash-API-sleutel direct in."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"直接輸入你的 Stash API 金鑰。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skriv inn Stash-API-nøkkelen direkte."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gib deinen Stash-API-Schlüssel direkt ein."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Digite sua chave de API do Stash diretamente."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wpisz bezpośrednio klucz API Stash."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Saisissez directement votre clé API Stash."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"StashのAPIキーを直接入力してください。"}}}},"hint_enter_your_stash_server_details":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enter your Stash server details to get started."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wpisz dane serwera Stash, aby rozpocząć."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"始めるには、Stashサーバーの情報を入力してください。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skriv inn detaljene for Stash-serveren din for å komme i gang."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"輸入你的 Stash 伺服器資訊以開始使用。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Insira os dados do seu servidor Stash para começar."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"输入你的 Stash 服务器详细信息以开始使用。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ange uppgifter om din Stash-server för att komma igång."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أدخل تفاصيل خادم Stash للبدء."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gib die Daten deines Stash-Servers ein, um loszulegen."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Indtast oplysninger om din Stash-server for at komme i gang."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Saisissez les détails de votre serveur Stash pour commencer."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voer de gegevens van je Stash-server in om te beginnen."}}}},"hint_every_condition_in_it_must":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aan elke voorwaarde erin moet worden voldaan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Każdy warunek w niej musi być spełniony"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"含まれるすべての条件に一致する必要があります"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"其中每個條件都必須符合"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alla villkor i den måste matcha"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"其中每个条件都必须匹配"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Every condition in it must match"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle betingelser i den skal matche"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jede Bedingung darin muss zutreffen"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Chacune de ses conditions doit correspondre"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Todas as condições dentro dele devem corresponder"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يجب أن يتطابق كل شرط فيه"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Alle betingelser i den må samsvare"}}}},"hint_excludes_everything_matching_conditions_below":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sluit alles uit wat aan de voorwaarden hieronder voldoet."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schließt alles aus, was die Bedingungen unten erfüllt."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wyklucza wszystko, co pasuje do poniższych warunków."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Udelukker alt, der matcher betingelserne nedenfor."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"排除符合下方條件的所有項目。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Excludes everything matching the conditions below."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utelater alt som samsvarer med betingelsene nedenfor."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"排除符合下方条件的所有内容。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Exclut tout ce qui correspond aux conditions ci-dessous."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Exclui tudo o que corresponde às condições abaixo."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Exkluderar allt som matchar villkoren nedan."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يستثني كل ما يطابق الشروط أدناه."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"以下の条件に一致するものをすべて除外します。"}}}},"hint_favorites_are_your_most_played":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Favoritter er scenene du har spilt mest."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お気に入りは、最も再生回数の多いシーンです。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Favoritos são suas cenas mais reproduzidas."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Favorites are your most played scenes."}},"ar":{"stri