s personnalisés."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Värden svarade, men inte som Stash. Kontrollera adress, undersökväg och anpassade headers."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verten svarte, men ikke som Stash. Sjekk adressen, understien og de egendefinerte headerne."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Host hat geantwortet, aber nicht als Stash. Prüfe Adresse, Unterpfad und eigene Header."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主機有回應，但不是 Stash。請檢查位址、子路徑和自訂標頭。"}}}},"hint_host_answered_with_web_page":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホストがStashではなくWebページで応答しました。ログインページまたはプロキシページの可能性があります。アドレスとカスタムヘッダーを確認してください。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Värden svarade med en webbsida, inte Stash – troligen en inloggnings- eller proxysida. Kontrollera adressen och anpassade headers."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'hôte a répondu avec une page web, pas Stash — probablement une page de connexion ou de proxy. Vérifiez l'adresse et les en-têtes personnalisés."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De host antwoordde met een webpagina, niet met Stash – waarschijnlijk een inlog- of proxypagina. Controleer het adres en de aangepaste headers."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verten svarte med en nettside, ikke Stash – sannsynligvis en innloggings- eller proxyside. Sjekk adressen og de egendefinerte headerne."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Værten svarede med en webside, ikke Stash – sandsynligvis en login- eller proxyside. Tjek adressen og de brugerdefinerede headers."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Host hat mit einer Webseite geantwortet, nicht als Stash – vermutlich eine Login- oder Proxy-Seite. Prüfe Adresse und eigene Header."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Host odpowiedział stroną internetową, a nie jako Stash — prawdopodobnie stroną logowania lub proxy. Sprawdź adres i własne nagłówki."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"استجاب المضيف بصفحة ويب وليس Stash — على الأرجح صفحة تسجيل دخول أو وكيل. تحقق من العنوان والترويسات المخصصة."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主機回應的是網頁而非 Stash — 可能是登入或代理伺服器頁面。請檢查位址和自訂標頭。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"主机返回的是网页而不是 Stash — 可能是登录页或代理页。请检查地址和自定义标头。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O host respondeu com uma página web, não com o Stash — provavelmente uma página de login ou de proxy. Verifique o endereço e os cabeçalhos personalizados."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The host answered with a web page, not Stash — likely a login or proxy page. Check the address and custom headers."}}}},"hint_how_long_scene_has_to":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンが再生済みとみなされ、位置が保存されるまでに必要な再生時間です。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Durée de lecture d'une scène avant qu'elle compte comme lue et que sa position soit enregistrée."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"المدة التي يجب أن يُشغَّل فيها المشهد قبل احتسابه كمُشغَّل وحفظ موضعه."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie lange eine Szene laufen muss, bevor sie als gespielt zählt und ihre Position gespeichert wird."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor længe en scene skal afspilles, før den tæller som afspillet, og positionen gemmes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片須播放多久才會計為已播放並儲存播放位置。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak długo scena musi być odtwarzana, aby została uznana za odtworzoną i zapisano jej pozycję."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片需要播放多长时间才会计为已播放并存储其播放位置。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"How long a scene has to play before it counts as played and its position is saved."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor lenge en scene må spilles før den telles som avspilt og posisjonen lagres."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur länge en scen måste spelas innan den räknas som spelad och positionen sparas."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoe lang een scène moet spelen voordat hij als afgespeeld telt en de positie wordt bewaard."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Por quanto tempo uma cena precisa ser reproduzida antes de contar como reproduzida e ter sua posição salva."}}}},"hint_how_much_each_part_steers":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"每个部分对推荐结果的影响程度。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak bardzo każdy element wpływa na wybór."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor mye hver del styrer utvalget."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dans quelle mesure chaque élément influence la sélection."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"How much each part steers the picks."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"各要素が選択にどの程度影響するかを設定します。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor meget hver del påvirker valgene."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"各項目對推薦結果的影響程度。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مدى تأثير كل جزء في الاختيارات."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie stark jeder Teil die Auswahl beeinflusst."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur mycket varje del styr urvalet."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoeveel elk onderdeel de keuzes bepaalt."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto cada parte influencia as escolhas."}}}},"hint_how_much_of_content_shows":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quantité de contenu visible à travers les boutons, pastilles et barres. S'applique à tous les éléments en verre."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jak bardzo zawartość prześwituje przez przyciski, etykiety i paski. Dotyczy wszystkich elementów ze szkła."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ボタン、ピル、バーからコンテンツがどの程度透けて見えるかを設定します。すべてのガラス要素に適用されます。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor mye av innholdet som synes gjennom knapper, piller og linjer. Gjelder all glass-chrome."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"按鈕、膠囊和列透出內容的程度。套用於所有玻璃介面元素。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"内容透过按钮、胶囊和栏的程度。适用于所有玻璃效果界面。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hvor meget af indholdet der skinner igennem knapper, piller og bjælker. Gælder for alle glaselementer."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مقدار ما يظهر من المحتوى عبر الأزرار والكبسولات والأشرطة. ينطبق على كل الواجهات الزجاجية."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hoeveel van de inhoud doorschijnt door knoppen, pillen en balken. Geldt voor alle glazen elementen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wie viel vom Inhalt durch Buttons, Pillen und Leisten scheint. Gilt für alle Glas-Elemente."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quanto do conteúdo aparece através de botões, pílulas e barras. Vale para todo o visual de vidro."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"How much of the content shows through buttons, pills and bars. Applies to all glass chrome."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hur mycket av innehållet som syns genom knappar, etiketter och fält. Gäller allt glas i gränssnittet."}}}},"hint_how_much_of_content_shows_through":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"内容透过覆盖在视频和图片上的玻璃按钮、胶囊和栏的程度。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quantité de contenu visible à travers les boutons, pastilles et barres en verre a