a aplicar todos os ajustes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已匯入 %@ 個伺服器和 %@ 項設定。請重新啟動 stashy 以套用所有設定。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تم استيراد %@ خادم و%@ إعداد. أعد تشغيل stashy لتطبيق جميع الإعدادات."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Importerte %@ server(e) og %@ innstilling(er). Start stashy på nytt for å ta i bruk alle innstillinger."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Imported %@ server(s) and %@ setting(s). Restart stashy to apply every setting."}}}},"hint_included_because_you_bought_stashy":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已包含，因为你在 3.0 之前以全价购买了 stashy。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enthalten, weil du stashy vor 3.0 zum vollen Preis gekauft hast."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"因你在 3.0 之前以原價購買了 stashy，故已包含。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Incluído porque você comprou o stashy pelo preço cheio antes da 3.0."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inbegrepen omdat je stashy vóór 3.0 tegen de volle prijs hebt gekocht."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مضمّن لأنك اشتريت stashy بالسعر الكامل قبل الإصدار 3.0."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Included because you bought stashy at full price before 3.0."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inkluderet, fordi du købte stashy til fuld pris før 3.0."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"3.0より前にstashyを通常価格で購入したため含まれています。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inclus car vous avez acheté stashy au prix plein avant la version 3.0."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ingår eftersom du köpte stashy till fullpris före 3.0."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inkludert fordi du kjøpte stashy til full pris før 3.0."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"W zestawie, ponieważ kupiłeś stashy w pełnej cenie przed wersją 3.0."}}}},"hint_keeps_scene_playing_in_small":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Låter en scen fortsätta spela i ett litet fält när du lämnar dess sida. Lägg till scener i bevakningslistan på scensidan så spelas de efter varandra; bevakningslisteknappen på Dashboard öppnar listan."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Laat een scène doorspelen in een kleine balk als je de pagina verlaat. Zet scènes op je kijklijst via de scènepagina en ze worden na elkaar afgespeeld; de kijklijstknop op het Dashboard opent de lijst."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンのページを離れても、小さなバーで再生を続けます。シーンのページでウォッチリストに追加すると順番に再生されます。Dashboardのウォッチリストボタンでリストを開けます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fortsætter med at afspille en scene i en lille bjælke, når du forlader dens side. Føj scener til Se senere på scenesiden, så afspilles de efter hinanden; knappen Se senere på Dashboard åbner listen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Odtwarza scenę dalej w małym pasku, gdy opuszczasz jej stronę. Dodawaj sceny do listy Do obejrzenia na stronie sceny, a będą odtwarzane jedna po drugiej; przycisk Do obejrzenia na Dashboardzie otwiera listę."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"离开短片页面时，短片会在一个小栏中继续播放。在短片页面将短片添加到稍后观看，它们会依次播放；Dashboard 上的稍后观看按钮可打开列表。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mantém uma cena em reprodução em uma barra pequena quando você sai da página dela. Adicione cenas à lista para assistir na página da cena e elas são reproduzidas uma após a outra; o botão da lista para assistir no Dashboard abre a lista."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spielt eine Szene in einer kleinen Leiste weiter, wenn du ihre Seite verlässt. Füge Szenen auf der Szenenseite deiner Merkliste hinzu, dann laufen sie nacheinander; der Merkliste-Button im Dashboard öffnet die Liste."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"離開短片頁面時，短片會在小型列中繼續播放。在短片頁面將短片加入待看清單，它們會依序播放；Dashboard 上的待看清單按鈕可打開清單。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Keeps a scene playing in a small bar when you leave its page. Add scenes to your watchlist on the scene page and they play one after another; the watchlist button on the Dashboard opens the list."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lar en scene fortsette å spille i en liten linje når du forlater siden. Legg til scener i Se senere på scenesiden, så spilles de etter hverandre; Se senere-knappen på Dashboard åpner listen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Poursuit la lecture d'une scène dans une petite barre quand vous quittez sa page. Ajoutez des scènes à votre liste à regarder depuis la page d'une scène et elles sont lues l'une après l'autre ; le bouton de liste à regarder du Dashboard ouvre la liste."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يُبقي المشهد قيد التشغيل في شريط صغير عند مغادرة صفحته. أضف مشاهد إلى قائمة المشاهدة من صفحة المشهد ليتم تشغيلها واحدًا تلو الآخر؛ يفتح زر قائمة المشاهدة في Dashboard القائمة."}}}},"hint_keeps_servers_api_keys_and":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"讓 iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 上的伺服器、API 金鑰和設定保持一致。需在每部裝置上個別開啟。使用中的伺服器仍由各裝置自行選擇。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"サーバー、APIキー、設定をiPhone、iPad、Macで同じに保ちます。デバイスごとにオンにしてください。使用中のサーバーは各デバイスで個別に選択されます。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mantém servidores, chaves de API e ajustes iguais no seu iPhone, iPad e Mac. Ative por dispositivo. O servidor ativo continua sendo escolha de cada dispositivo."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Holder servere, API-nøgler og indstillinger ens på din iPhone, iPad og Mac. Slå det til på hver enhed. Den aktive server vælges stadig på hver enkelt enhed."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Garde les serveurs, clés API et réglages identiques sur votre iPhone, iPad et Mac. À activer sur chaque appareil. Le serveur actif reste le choix propre à chaque appareil."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hält Server, API-Schlüssel und Einstellungen auf iPhone, iPad und Mac gleich. Schalte es pro Gerät ein. Der aktive Server bleibt die Wahl jedes Geräts."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utrzymuje te same serwery, klucze API i ustawienia na iPhonie, iPadzie i Macu. Włącz na każdym urządzeniu osobno. Aktywny serwer pozostaje wyborem każdego urządzenia."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Keeps servers, API keys and settings the same on your iPhone, iPad and Mac. Turn it on per device. The active server stays each device's own choice."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Houdt servers, API-sleutels en instellingen gelijk op je iPhone, iPad en Mac. Schakel het per apparaat in. De actieve server blijft een keuze per apparaat."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"让你的 iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 上的服务器、API 密钥和设置保持一致。需在每台设备上分别打开。当前服务器由每台设备各自选择。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Håller servrar, API-nycklar och inställningar likadana på din iPhone, iPad och Mac. Slå på det per enhet. Den aktiva servern väljs fortfarande per enhet."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يُبقي الخوادم ومفاتيح API والإعدادات متطابقة على iPhone وiPad وMac. فعّله لكل جهاز على حدة. يبقى الخادم النشط اختيار كل جهاز على حدة."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Holder servere, API-nøkler og innstillinger like på iPhone, iPad og Mac. Slå det på for hver enhet. Den aktive serveren er hver enhets eget valg."}}}},"hint_language_scenes_subtitles_start_with":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اللغة التي تبدأ بها ترجمات المشهد. «أي» يأخذ أول مسار عادي في الملف."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De taal waarmee de ondertiteling van een scène begint. 'Elke' neemt het eerste gewone spoor in het bestand."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Språket en scenes undertekster starter med. «Hvilket som helst» tar det første vanlige sporet i filen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The language a scene's subtitles start with. \"Any\" takes the first ordinary track in the file."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Språket som en scens undertexter börjar med. ”Valfri” tar det första vanliga spåret i filen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Langue des sous-titres au démarrage d'une scène. « Tous » prend la première piste ordinaire du fichier."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片字幕默认使用的语言。“任意”表示使用文件中的第一个普通字幕轨道。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"短片字幕預設使用的語言。「任意」會採用檔案中的第一個一般字幕軌。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンの字幕の初期言語です。「指定なし」ではファイル内の最初の通常トラックを使用します。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Język, od którego zaczynają się napisy sceny. „Dowolny” wybiera pierwszą zwykłą ścieżkę w pliku."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Det sprog, en scenes undertekster starter med. \"Enhver\" tager det første almindelige spor i filen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O idioma com que as legendas de uma cena começam. \"Qualquer\" usa a primeira faixa comum do arquivo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Sprache, mit der die Untertitel einer Szene starten. „Beliebig“ nimmt die erste normale Spur der Datei."}}}},"hint_leaves_out_what_group_matches":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"排除該群組符合的項目"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deixa de fora o que o grupo corresponde"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt weg, was die Gruppe erfüllt"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Udelader det, gruppen matcher"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utelater det gruppen samsvarer med"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"グループに一致するものを除外"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Laat weg wat aan de groep voldoet"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utelämnar det som gruppen matchar"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"排除该组匹配的内容"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يستبعد ما تطابقه المجموعة"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Exclut ce qui correspond au groupe"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pomija to, co pasuje do grupy"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Leaves out what the group matches"}}}},"hint_legend_run_performer_is_no":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utøveren i Legend-runden er ikke lenger i dette utvalget. Tilbakestill runden."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لم يعد مؤدي جولة Legend ضمن هذه المجموعة. أعد تعيين الجولة."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kunstneren i Legend-runden er ikke længere i denne pulje. Nulstil runden."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De performer van de Legend-run zit niet meer in deze pool. Stel de run opnieuw in."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legend 回合的演員已不在此參賽名單中。請重置回合。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legendランの出演者がこのプールに存在しません。ランをリセットしてください。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legend run performer is no longer in this pool. Run reset."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O artista da rodada Legend não está mais neste grupo de seleção. Redefina a rodada."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Der Darsteller des Legend-Laufs ist nicht mehr in diesem Pool. Setze den Lauf zurück."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktora z rundy Legend nie ma już w tej puli. Zresetuj rundę."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legend-omgångens stjärna finns inte längre i urvalet. Återställ omgången."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Legend 回合中的演员已不在此候选池中。请重置回合。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le performeur de la partie Legend ne fait plus partie de cette sélection. Réinitialisez la partie."}}}},"hint_lets_you_create_edit_rename":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Damit kannst du die auf deinem Server gespeicherten Filter erstellen, bearbeiten, umbenennen und löschen, unter Einstellungen › Server."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Låter dig skapa, redigera, byta namn på och radera filtren som sparats på servern, under Inställningar › Server."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pozwala tworzyć, edytować, zmieniać nazwy i usuwać filtry zapisane na serwerze, w Ustawienia › Serwer."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Permet de créer, modifier, renommer et supprimer les filtres enregistrés sur votre serveur, dans Réglages › Serveur."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Permite criar, editar, renomear e apagar os filtros salvos no seu servidor, em Ajustes › Servidor."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"可在“设置 › 服务器”中创建、编辑、重命名和删除存储在服务器上的过滤器。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"サーバーに保存されたフィルターを作成、編集、名前変更、削除できます。設定 › サーバーから利用できます。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"讓你在「設定 › 伺服器」中建立、編輯、重新命名和刪除伺服器上儲存的篩選條件。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lar deg opprette, redigere, gi nytt navn til og slette filtrene som er lagret på serveren, under Innstillinger › Server."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hiermee kun je de filters die op je server zijn bewaard aanmaken, wijzigen, hernoemen en verwijderen, onder Instellingen › Server."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lets you create, edit, rename and delete the filters saved on your server, under Settings › Server."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يتيح لك إنشاء الفلاتر المحفوظة على الخادم وتعديلها وإعادة تسميتها وحذفها، من الإعدادات › الخادم."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lader dig oprette, redigere, omdøbe og slette de filtre, der er gemt på din server, under Indstillinger › Server."}}}},"hint_lgpl_3_0_with_app":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0（App Store / DRM例外付き）"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, mit einer App-Store-/DRM-Ausnahme"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0، مع استثناء لـ App Store / DRM"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0 z wyjątkiem App Store / DRM"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, med unntak for App Store / DRM"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, com exceção para App Store / DRM"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0，附 App Store／DRM 例外條款"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, med en undtagelse for App Store/DRM"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0，附 App Store / DRM 例外条款"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, med ett undantag för App Store/DRM"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, with an App Store / DRM exception"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, met een uitzondering voor App Store / DRM"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"LGPL-3.0, avec une exception App Store / DRM"}}}},"hint_library_arg_arg_play_arg":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Biblioteca %@ · Ø %@/reprodução · %@ não reproduzidas"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bibliotek %@ · Ø %@/avspilling · %@ ikke avspi