kkelen."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Log ind med dine Stash-loginoplysninger for at hente API-nøglen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使用你的 Stash 帳號密碼登入以取得 API 金鑰。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Melde dich mit deinen Stash-Zugangsdaten an, um den API-Schlüssel abzurufen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Connectez-vous avec vos identifiants Stash pour récupérer la clé API."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zaloguj się danymi Stash, aby pobrać klucz API."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"StashのログインIDとパスワードでログインして、APIキーを取得します。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"سجّل الدخول ببيانات اعتماد Stash لاسترداد مفتاح API."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Log in met je Stash-gegevens om de API-sleutel op te halen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Login with your Stash credentials to retrieve the API key."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Logga in med dina Stash-uppgifter för att hämta API-nyckeln."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使用你的 Stash 凭证登录以获取 API 密钥。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Faça login com suas credenciais do Stash para obter a chave de API."}}}},"hint_love_spouse_2_4g_toys":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g 玩具使用 BLE 廣播。請確定藍牙已開啟，且玩具處於配對／掃描模式。範圍內的所有玩具會同時反應。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g-leksaker använder BLE-annonsering. Se till att Bluetooth är på och att leksaken är i parkopplings-/sökläge. Alla leksaker inom räckhåll reagerar samtidigt."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g-leketøy bruker BLE-annonsering. Sørg for at Bluetooth er slått på og at leketøyet er i paringsmodus/skannemodus. Alle leketøy innenfor rekkevidde reagerer samtidig."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4gトイはBLEアドバタイズを使用します。Bluetoothがオンで、トイがペアリング/スキャンモードになっていることを確認してください。範囲内のすべてのトイが同時に反応します。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Brinquedos Love Spouse 2.4g usam anúncios BLE. Verifique se o Bluetooth está ativado e se o brinquedo está em modo de pareamento/busca. Todos os brinquedos ao alcance reagirão ao mesmo tempo."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4G-speeltjes gebruiken BLE-advertising. Zorg dat Bluetooth aanstaat en het speeltje in koppel-/scanmodus staat. Alle speeltjes binnen bereik reageren tegelijk."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les jouets Love Spouse 2.4g utilisent les annonces BLE. Vérifiez que le Bluetooth est activé et que le jouet est en mode appairage/recherche. Tous les jouets à portée réagiront simultanément."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g-legetøj bruger BLE-annoncering. Sørg for, at Bluetooth er slået til, og at legetøjet er i parrings-/scanningstilstand. Alt legetøj inden for rækkevidde reagerer samtidigt."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love-Spouse-2.4g-Toys nutzen BLE-Advertising. Stelle sicher, dass Bluetooth aktiv ist und das Toy im Kopplungs-/Suchmodus ist. Alle Toys in Reichweite reagieren gleichzeitig."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zabawki Love Spouse 2.4g używają rozgłaszania BLE. Upewnij się, że Bluetooth jest włączony, a zabawka jest w trybie parowania/skanowania. Obie zabawki w zasięgu zareagują jednocześnie."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4G 玩具使用 BLE 广播。请确保已开启蓝牙且玩具处于配对/扫描模式。范围内的所有玩具都会同时响应。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تستخدم ألعاب Love Spouse بتردد 2.4g الإعلان عبر BLE. تأكد من تفعيل Bluetooth وأن اللعبة في وضع الإقران/البحث. ستتفاعل كل الألعاب ضمن النطاق في الوقت نفسه."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Love Spouse 2.4g toys use BLE advertising. Ensure Bluetooth is enabled and the toy is in pairing/scan mode. Both toys in range will react simultaneously."}}}},"hint_match_and_rateme_are_part":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match og RateMe er en del av stashy+."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"MatchとRateMeはstashy+の機能です。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match og RateMe er en del af stashy+."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match och RateMe ingår i stashy+."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match 和 RateMe 属于 stashy+。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match 和 RateMe 是 stashy+ 的一部分。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match en RateMe maken deel uit van stashy+."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match und RateMe sind Teil von stashy+."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match i RateMe są częścią stashy+."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match وRateMe جزء من stashy+."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match and RateMe are part of stashy+."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match et RateMe font partie de stashy+."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Match e RateMe fazem parte do stashy+."}}}},"hint_matches_performer_studio_and_tag":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"將演員、工作室和標籤名稱與檔案路徑比對，並加入短片、圖片和圖庫。較短的名稱可能會誤判。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matcher kunstner-, studie- og tagnavne med filstier og føjer dem til scener, billeder og gallerier. Korte navne kan matche ved en fejl."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matches performer, studio and tag names against file paths and adds them to scenes, images and galleries. Short names can match by mistake."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matchar namn på stjärnor, studior och taggar mot filsökvägar och lägger till dem i scener, bilder och gallerier. Korta namn kan ge felaktiga träffar."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dopasowuje nazwy aktorów, studiów i tagów do ścieżek plików i dodaje je do scen, obrazów i galerii. Krótkie nazwy mogą dopasować się przez pomyłkę."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compara nomes de artistas, estúdios e etiquetas com os caminhos dos arquivos e os adiciona a cenas, imagens e galerias. Nomes curtos podem corresponder por engano."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vergelijkt namen van performers, studio's en labels met bestandspaden en voegt ze toe aan scènes, afbeeldingen en galerijen. Korte namen kunnen per ongeluk overeenkomen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compare les noms de performeurs, studios et étiquettes aux chemins de fichiers et les ajoute aux scènes, images et galeries. Les noms courts peuvent correspondre par erreur."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sammenligner utøver-, studio- og taggnavn med filstier og legger dem til scener, bilder og gallerier. Korte navn kan gi feil treff."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"出演者、スタジオ、タグの名前をファイルパスと照合し、シーン、画像、ギャラリーに追加します。短い名前は誤って一致することがあります。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gleicht Darsteller-, Studio- und Tag-Namen mit Dateipfaden ab und fügt sie Szenen, Bildern und Galerien hinzu. Kurze Namen können versehentlich passen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"将演员、工作室和标签名称与文件路径进行匹配，并将其添加到短片、图片和图库。较短的名称可能会误匹配。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يطابق أسماء المؤدين والاستوديوهات والوسوم مع مسارات الملفات ويضيفها إلى المشاهد والصور والمعارض. قد تتطابق الأسماء القصيرة عن طريق الخطأ."}}}},"hint_matches_when_at_least_one":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Correspond si au moins une condition ci-dessous est remplie."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"只要符合下方至少一個條件即算相符。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Komt overeen als aan minstens één voorwaarde hieronder is voldaan."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Trifft zu, wenn mindestens eine Bedingung unten erfüllt ist."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يتطابق عندما يتحقق شرط واحد على الأقل مما يلي."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Corresponde quando pelo menos uma condição abaixo é verdadeira."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下方至少有一个条件成立时即匹配。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matchar när minst ett villkor nedan är uppfyllt."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"下の条件のうち少なくとも1つが真の場合に一致します。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matches when at least one condition below is true."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Samsvarer når minst én betingelse nedenfor er oppfylt."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Matcher, når mindst én betingelse nedenfor er opfyldt."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pasuje, gdy co najmniej jeden z poniższych warunków jest spełniony."}}}},"hint_mini_player_arg_opens_player":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"المشغّل المصغّر: %@. يفتح المشغّل"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"迷你播放器：%@。打開播放器"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ミニプレーヤー：%@。プレーヤーを開きます"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mini player: %@. Opens the player"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Minispiller: %@. Åpner spilleren"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"迷你播放器：%@。打开播放器"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniafspiller: %@. Åbner afspilleren"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Minispeler: %@. Opent de speler"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Minispelare: %@. Öppnar spelaren"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mini-lecteur : %@. Ouvre le lecteur"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniodtwarzacz: %@. Otwiera odtwarzacz"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniplayer: %@. Abre o player"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miniplayer: %@. Öffnet den Player"}}}},"hint_missing_from_store_offering_arg":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ストアのオファリングにありません：%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"商店方案中缺少：%@"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausente da oferta da loja: %@"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"商店产品中缺少：%@"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mangler i butikktilbudet: %@"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Saknas i butikens utbud: %@"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ontbreekt in het winkelaanbod: %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Absent de l'offre de la boutique : %@"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mangler i butikkens udbud: %@"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Missing from the store offering: %@"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Brak w ofercie sklepu: %@"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"غير موجود في عرض المتجر: %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fehlt im Store-Angebot: %@"}}}},"hint_monthly_yearly_or_lifetime_bought":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensuel, annuel ou à vie. Vous avez déjà acheté stashy+ avec ce compte Google ou réinstallé l'app ? Touchez Restaurer les achats."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Maandelijks, jaarlijks of levenslang. Eerder stashy+ gekocht met dit Google-account of opnieuw geïnstalleerd? Tik op 'Herstel aankopen'."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månedlig, årlig eller livstid. Har du kjøpt stashy+ før med denne Google-kontoen, eller installert på nytt? Trykk på Gjenopprett kjøp."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"按月、按年或终身。之前曾用此 Google 帐户购买过 stashy+ 或重新安装了 App？请轻点“恢复购买”。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"شهري أو سنوي أو دائم. هل اشتريت stashy+ سابقًا بحساب Google هذا، أو أعدت التثبيت؟ اضغط على «استعادة المشتريات»."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månad, år eller livstid. Har du köpt stashy+ tidigare med det här Google-kontot eller installerat om? Tryck på Återställ köp."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Monthly, Yearly, or Lifetime. Bought stashy+ before with this Google account, or reinstalled? Tap Restore Purchases."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"月額、年額、または買い切り。このGoogleアカウントで以前stashy+を購入した場合や再インストールした場合は、「購入を復元」をタップしてください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Monatlich, jährlich oder lebenslang. stashy+ schon mit diesem Google-Konto gekauft oder neu installiert? Tippe auf „Käufe wiederherstellen“."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensal, anual ou vitalício. Já comprou o stashy+ com esta conta Google ou reinstalou o app? Toque em Restaurar compras."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miesięcznie, rocznie lub dożywotnio. Kupiłeś już stashy+ na tym koncie Google lub zainstalowałeś ponownie? Stuknij Odtwórz zakupy."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månedlig, årlig eller livstid. Har du købt stashy+ før med denne Google-konto eller geninstalleret? Tryk på Gendan køb."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"月訂、年訂或終身版。之前曾以此 Google 帳號購買 stashy+，或重新安裝了 App？請點「恢復購買項目」。"}}}},"hint_monthly_yearly_or_lifetime_if":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensal, anual ou vitalício. Se você comprou o stashy como app pago antes da 3.0, ou acabou de sair do TestFlight, toque em Restaurar compras."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"按月、按年或终身。如果你在 3.0 之前以付费 App 的形式购买过 stashy，或刚从 TestFlight 切换过来，请轻点“恢复购买”。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månedlig, årlig eller livstid. Hvis du købte stashy som betalt app før 3.0 eller lige har skiftet fra TestFlight, så tryk på Gendan køb."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"月額、年額、または買い切り。3.0より前に有料アプリとしてstashyを購入した場合や、TestFlightから切り替えた直後の場合は、「購入を復元」をタップしてください。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mensuel, annuel ou à vie. Si vous avez acheté stashy comme app payante avant la 3.0, ou venez de quitter TestFlight, touchez Restaurer les achats."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Månedlig, årlig eller livstid. Hvis du kjøpte stashy som betalt app før 3.0, eller nettopp har gått over fra TestFlight, trykker du på Gjenopprett kjøp."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"شهري أو سنوي أو دائم. إذا اشتريت stashy كتطبيق مدفوع قبل الإصدار 3.0، أو انتقلت للتو من TestFlight، فاضغط على «استعادة المشتريات»."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"月訂、年訂或終身版。如果你在 3.0 之前以付費 App 形式購買了 stashy，或剛從 TestFlight 轉換過來，請點「恢復購買項目」。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Miesięcznie, rocznie lub dożywotnio. Jeśli kupiłeś stashy jako płatną aplikację przed wersją 3.0 lub właśnie przeszedłeś z TestFlight, stuknij Odtwórz zakupy."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Monthly, Yearly, or Lifetime. If you bought stashy as a paid app before 3.0, or just switched from TestFlight, tap Restore Purchases."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Maandelijks, jaarlijks of levenslang. Heb je stashy vóór 3.0 als betaalde app gekocht, of ben je net overgestapt van TestFlight, tik dan op 'Herstel aankopen'."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Monatlich, jährlich oder lebenslang. Hast du stashy vor 3.0 als bezahlte