needs_review","value":"Nombre de lectures, historique, point de reprise et durée de visionnage sur le serveur. Le menu du lecteur permet de le suspendre pour une scène."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal afspilninger, historik, genoptagelsespunkt og afspilningstid på serveren. Afspillermenuen kan sætte det på pause for én scene."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生回数、履歴、再開位置、再生時間をサーバーに記録します。プレーヤーメニューで1つのシーンだけ一時停止できます。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspeelaantal, geschiedenis, hervatpunt en kijktijd op de server. Het spelermenu kan dit voor één scène pauzeren."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antall avspillinger, historikk, gjenopptakingspunkt og seertid på serveren. Spillermenyen kan sette det på pause for én scene."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"عدد مرات التشغيل والسجل ونقطة الاستئناف ووقت المشاهدة على الخادم. يمكن لقائمة المشغّل إيقاف ذلك مؤقتًا لمشهد واحد."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"伺服器上的播放次數、紀錄、續播位置和觀看時間。播放器選單可針對單一短片暫停記錄。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal visningar, historik, återupptagningspunkt och visningstid på servern. Spelarmenyn kan pausa det för en scen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Play count, history, resume point and watch time on the server. The player menu can pause it for one scene."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Contagem de reproduções, histórico, ponto de retomada e tempo assistido no servidor. O menu do player pode pausar isso para uma cena."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"服务器上的播放次数、历史记录、续播位置和观看时长。可通过播放器菜单对单个短片暂停记录。"}}}},"hint_plays_scenes_back_to_back":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Odtwarza sceny jedna po drugiej z wiersza ekranu Start: ostatnio wydane, ostatnio dodane lub Twoje zapisane filtry scen. Strony aktorów, studiów, tagów i grup mają własny kanał."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Reproduz cenas em sequência a partir de uma linha do Início: lançadas recentemente, adicionadas recentemente ou seus filtros salvos de cenas. Páginas de artistas, estúdios, etiquetas e grupos têm seu próprio canal."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يشغّل المشاهد متتالية من صف في الرئيسية: الصادرة حديثًا أو المضافة حديثًا أو فلاتر المشاهد المحفوظة. تحصل صفحات المؤدين والاستوديوهات والوسوم والمجموعات على قناتها الخاصة."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spiller scener etter hverandre fra en rad på Hjem: nylig utgitt, nylig lagt til eller de lagrede scenefiltrene dine. Utøver-, studio-, tagg- og gruppesider får sin egen kanal."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Plays scenes back to back from a row on Home: recently released, recently added or your saved scene filters. Performer, studio, tag and group pages get their own channel."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"從首頁的某一列連續播放短片：最近發行、最近加入或你已儲存的短片篩選條件。演員、工作室、標籤和群組頁面也有各自的頻道。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speelt scènes achter elkaar af uit een rij op Home: recent uitgebracht, recent toegevoegd of je bewaarde scènefilters. Pagina's van performers, studio's, labels en groepen krijgen hun eigen kanaal."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspiller scener efter hinanden fra en række på Hjem: senest udgivet, senest tilføjet eller dine gemte scenefiltre. Sider for kunstnere, studier, tags og grupper får deres egen kanal."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lit les scènes à la suite depuis une rangée de l'accueil : sorties récentes, ajouts récents ou vos filtres de scènes enregistrés. Les pages de performeur, studio, étiquette et groupe ont leur propre chaîne."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spelar scener i följd från en rad på Hem: nyligen släppta, nyligen tillagda eller dina sparade scenfilter. Sidor för stjärnor, studior, taggar och grupper får en egen kanal."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"连续播放主页某一行中的短片：最近发行、最近添加或你的已存短片过滤器。演员、工作室、标签和集合页面有各自的频道。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spielt Szenen nacheinander aus einer Zeile auf Start: kürzlich erschienen, kürzlich hinzugefügt oder deine gespeicherten Szenenfilter. Darsteller-, Studio-, Tag- und Gruppenseiten haben einen eigenen Kanal."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームの行からシーンを連続再生します：最近リリース、最近追加、または保存済みシーンフィルター。出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループのページにはそれぞれ専用のチャンネルがあります。"}}}},"hint_please_configure_your_stash_server":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يُرجى تكوين خادم Stash للبدء."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請設定你的 Stash 伺服器以開始使用。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurera din Stash-server för att komma igång."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configure seu servidor Stash para começar."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Please configure your Stash server to get started."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stel je Stash-server in om te beginnen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"始めるにはStashサーバーを設定してください。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer din Stash-server for at komme i gang."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请配置你的 Stash 服务器以开始使用。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Richte deinen Stash-Server ein, um loszulegen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer Stash-serveren din for å komme i gang."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skonfiguruj serwer Stash, aby rozpocząć."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configurez votre serveur Stash pour commencer."}}}},"hint_please_enable_dashboard_performers_studios":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktivera Dashboard, Stjärnor, Studior, Taggar, Grupper eller Markörer i Inställningar"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå på Dashboard, Utøvere, Studioer, Tagger, Grupper eller Markører i Innstillinger"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Włącz w Ustawieniach Dashboard, Aktorów, Studia, Tagi, Grupy lub Znaczniki"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktiviere Dashboard, Darsteller, Studios, Tags, Gruppen oder Marker in den Einstellungen"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå Dashboard, Kunstnere, Studier, Tags, Grupper eller Markører til i Indstillinger"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"設定でDashboard、出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループ、マーカーのいずれかを有効にしてください"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schakel Dashboard, Performers, Studio's, Labels, Groepen of Markeringen in bij Instellingen"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ative Dashboard, Artistas, Estúdios, Etiquetas, Grupos ou Marcadores em Ajustes"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يُرجى تفعيل Dashboard أو المؤدين أو الاستوديوهات أو الوسوم أو المجموعات أو العلامات في الإعدادات"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请在设置中启用 Dashboard、演员、工作室、标签、集合或标记"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Please enable Dashboard, Performers, Studios, Tags, Groups or Markers in Settings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請在「設定」中啟用 Dashboard、演員、工作室、標籤、群組或標記"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Activez Dashboard, Performeurs, Studios, Étiquettes, Groupes ou Marqueurs dans les réglages"}}}},"hint_premium_features_including_channels_continuous":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"進階功能，包括頻道 — 連續播放某位演員、工作室、標籤或已儲存篩選條件的內容。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funkcje premium, w tym kanały — ciągłe odtwarzanie aktora, studia, tagu lub zapisanego filtra."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"高级功能，包括频道 — 连续播放某位演员、工作室、标签或已存过滤器的内容。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium-Funktionen, darunter Kanäle – fortlaufende Wiedergabe eines Darstellers, Studios, Tags oder gespeicherten Filters."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"チャンネル（出演者、スタジオ、タグ、保存済みフィルターの連続再生）などのプレミアム機能。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, bland annat Kanaler – kontinuerlig uppspelning av en stjärna, studio, tagg eller ett sparat filter."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fonctions premium, dont les chaînes — lecture continue d'un performeur, studio, étiquette ou filtre enregistré."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, herunder Kanaler – fortløbende afspilning af en kunstner, et studie, et tag eller et gemt filter."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium features, including Channels — continuous playback of a performer, studio, tag or saved filter."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ميزات مميزة، بما فيها القنوات — تشغيل متواصل لمؤدٍّ أو استوديو أو وسم أو فلتر محفوظ."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Recursos premium, incluindo Canais — reprodução contínua de um artista, estúdio, etiqueta ou filtro salvo."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunksjoner, inkludert kanaler – kontinuerlig avspilling av en utøver, et studio, en tagg eller et lagret filter."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfuncties, waaronder Kanalen – doorlopend afspelen van een performer, studio, label of bewaard filter."}}}},"hint_purchase_pending_it_unlocks_once":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Purchase pending — it unlocks once payment completes."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Achat en attente — le déblocage a lieu une fois le paiement effectué."}},"nl":{"stringUn