Cloud 鑰匙圈才能同步。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"الإعدادات الموجودة بالفعل في iCloud تحل محل الإعدادات على هذا الجهاز. مفاتيح API مشفرة تشفيرًا تامًا عبر سلسلة مفاتيح iCloud، التي يجب تفعيلها لمزامنتها."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Instellingen die al in iCloud staan, vervangen die op dit apparaat. API-sleutels worden end-to-end versleuteld via iCloud-sleutelhanger, die aan moet staan om ze te synchroniseren."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Innstillinger som allerede ligger i iCloud, erstatter dem på denne enheten. API-nøkler er ende-til-ende-kryptert via iCloud-nøkkelring, som må være på for at de skal synkroniseres."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Einstellungen, die schon in iCloud liegen, ersetzen die auf diesem Gerät. API-Schlüssel sind über den iCloud-Schlüsselbund Ende-zu-Ende-verschlüsselt; er muss für ihre Synchronisierung aktiv sein."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ustawienia już zapisane w iCloud zastąpią te na tym urządzeniu. Klucze API są szyfrowane end-to-end przez pęk kluczy iCloud, który musi być włączony, aby były synchronizowane."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"iCloudにすでにある設定が、このデバイスの設定を置き換えます。APIキーはiCloudキーチェーンでエンドツーエンド暗号化されます。同期するにはiCloudキーチェーンをオンにする必要があります。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inställningar som redan finns i iCloud ersätter dem på den här enheten. API-nycklar krypteras från ände till ände via iCloud-nyckelring, som måste vara på för att de ska synkas."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Indstillinger, der allerede er i iCloud, erstatter dem på denne enhed. API-nøgler er end-to-end-krypteret via iCloud-nøglering, som skal være slået til, for at de synkroniseres."}}}},"hint_show_edit_buttons_on_scene":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afficher les boutons de modification sur les cartes de détail des scènes (performeurs, studio, groupes, galeries, étiquettes, titre, description) et sur les pages de performeur / studio / étiquette / groupe / galerie."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bearbeiten-Buttons auf den Karten der Szenendetails (Darsteller, Studio, Gruppen, Galerien, Tags, Titel, Beschreibung) und in den Details von Darstellern / Studios / Tags / Gruppen / Galerien anzeigen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pokazuj przyciski edycji na kartach szczegółów sceny (aktorzy, studio, grupy, galerie, tagi, tytuł, opis) oraz na stronach aktora / studia / tagu / grupy / galerii."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"إظهار أزرار التعديل على بطاقات تفاصيل المشهد (المؤدون، الاستوديو، المجموعات، المعارض، الوسوم، العنوان، الوصف) وعلى تفاصيل المؤدي / الاستوديو / الوسم / المجموعة / المعرض."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在短片詳細資訊卡片（演員、工作室、群組、圖庫、標籤、標題、描述）以及演員／工作室／標籤／群組／圖庫詳細資訊上顯示編輯按鈕。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Show edit buttons on scene detail cards (performers, studio, groups, galleries, tags, title, description) and on performer / studio / tag / group / gallery detail."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vis redigeringsknapper på kortene på scenesiden (utøvere, studio, grupper, gallerier, tagger, tittel, beskrivelse) og på detaljsidene for utøver / studio / tagg / gruppe / galleri."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Visa redigeringsknappar på scenens detaljkort (stjärnor, studio, grupper, gallerier, taggar, titel, beskrivning) och på detaljsidor för stjärna/studio/tagg/grupp/galleri."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーン詳細のカード（出演者、スタジオ、グループ、ギャラリー、タグ、タイトル、説明）と、出演者 / スタジオ / タグ / グループ / ギャラリーの詳細に編集ボタンを表示します。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toon wijzigknoppen op de kaarten van scènedetails (performers, studio, groepen, galerijen, labels, titel, beschrijving) en op de details van performers, studio's, labels, groepen en galerijen."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vis redigeringsknapper på scenens detaljekort (kunstnere, studie, grupper, gallerier, tags, titel, beskrivelse) og på detaljesider for kunstner/studie/tag/gruppe/galleri."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在短片详细信息卡片（演员、工作室、集合、图库、标签、标题、描述）以及演员 / 工作室 / 标签 / 集合 / 图库详细信息页面上显示编辑按钮。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostrar botões de edição nos cartões de detalhes da cena (artistas, estúdio, grupos, galerias, etiquetas, título, descrição) e nos detalhes de artista / estúdio / etiqueta / grupo / galeria."}}}},"hint_shows_all_arg_matching_search":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Visar alla %@ som matchar sökningen"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zeigt alle %@, die zur Suche passen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Shows all %@ matching the search"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يعرض كل %@ المطابقة للبحث"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"顯示所有符合搜尋的%@"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toont alle %@ die bij de zoekopdracht passen"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"検索に一致するすべての%@を表示します"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser alle %@ som samsvarer med søket"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Affiche tous les résultats (%@) correspondant à la recherche"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"显示所有与搜索匹配的%@"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser alle %@, der matcher søgningen"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pokazuje wszystkie %@ pasujące do wyszukiwania"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostra todos os %@ que correspondem à busca"}}}},"hint_shows_o_counts_of_your":{"localizations":{"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pokazuje w Narzędziach liczniki O Twoich scen i obrazów jako kalendarz miesięczny."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser O-tellerne for scenene og bildene dine som en månedskalender i Verktøy."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Visar O-räknarna för dina scener och bilder som en månadskalender i Verktyg."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zeigt die O-Zähler deiner Szenen und Bilder als Monatskalender in Werkzeuge."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンと画像のOカウントを月間カレンダーとしてツールに表示します。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中以月历形式显示你的短片和图片的 O 计数。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يعرض عدّادات O لمشاهدك وصورك كتقويم شهري في الأدوات."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostra as contagens O das suas cenas e imagens como um calendário mensal em Ferramentas."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toont de O-tellers van je scènes en afbeeldingen als maandkalender in Tools."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中以月曆顯示你的短片和圖片的 O 計數。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Shows the O Counts of your scenes and images as a month calendar in Tools."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Affiche les compteurs O de vos scènes et images sous forme de calendrier mensuel dans Outils."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser O-tællerne for dine scener og billeder som en månedskalender i Værktøjer."}}}},"hint_shows_similar_scenes_on_scene":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يعرض مشاهد مشابهة في صفحة المشهد. عند انتهاء مشهد، يُقترح مشهد مشابه كالتالي."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Shows similar scenes on the scene page. When a scene ends, a similar one is offered as Up Next."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostra cenas semelhantes na página da cena. Quando uma cena termina, uma semelhante é oferecida em A Seguir."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pokazuje podobne sceny na stronie sceny. Gdy scena się skończy, podobna jest proponowana jako następna."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在短片頁面顯示相似短片。短片結束時，會提供一部相似短片作為「下一部」。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Visar liknande scener på scensidan. När en scen slutar erbjuds en liknande som Nästa."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"シーンのページに類似シーンを表示します。シーンが終わると、類似シーンが「次に再生」として提示されます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zeigt ähnliche Szenen auf der Szenenseite. Endet eine Szene, wird eine ähnliche als Nächstes angeboten."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在短片页面显示相似短片。短片结束时，会提供一个相似短片作为“接下来播放”。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toont vergelijkbare scènes op de scènepagina. Als een scène afloopt, wordt een vergelijkbare aangeboden als volgende."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser lignende scener på scenesiden. Når en scene slutter, tilbydes en lignende som Næste."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser lignende scener på scenesiden. Når en scene slutter, tilbys en lignende som neste."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Affiche des scènes similaires sur la page d'une scène. À la fin d'une scène, une scène similaire est proposée en lecture suivante."}}}},"hint_shows_unrated_scenes_or_images":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未評価のシーンや画像をツールで1つずつ表示し、星で評価できます。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pokazuje w Narzędziach nieocenione sceny lub obrazy pojedynczo, aby można było ocenić je gwiazdkami."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostra cenas ou imagens sem avaliação, uma de cada vez, em Ferramentas, para você avaliá-las com estrelas."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Shows unrated scenes or images one at a time in Tools, so you can rate them with stars."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toont onbeoordeelde scènes of afbeeldingen een voor een in Tools, zodat je ze met sterren kunt beoordelen."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يعرض المشاهد أو الصور غير المقيّمة واحدة تلو الأخرى في الأدوات، لتقييمها بالنجوم."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中逐个显示未评分的短片或图片，方便你用星级为其评分。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Visar obetygsatta scener eller bilder en i taget i Verktyg så att du kan betygsätta dem med stjärnor."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Affiche une à une les scènes ou images sans note dans Outils, pour que vous les notiez avec des étoiles."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser ubedømte scener eller billeder ét ad gangen i Værktøjer, så du kan bedømme dem med stjerner."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zeigt unbewertete Szenen oder Bilder einzeln in Werkzeuge, damit du sie mit Sternen bewerten kannst."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中逐一顯示未評分的短片或圖片，讓你以星等評分。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser ikke-vurderte scener eller bilder ett om gangen i Verktøy, slik at du kan gi dem stjerner."}}}},"hint_shows_unrated_scenes_or_images_one":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser ubedømte scener eller billeder ét ad gangen under Opdag, så du kan bedømme dem med stjerner."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Affiche une à une les scènes ou images sans note dans Découvrir, pour que vous les notiez avec des étoiles."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pokazuje w sekcji Odkrywaj nieocenione sceny lub obrazy pojedynczo, aby można było ocenić je gwiazdkami."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Visar obetygsatta scener eller bilder en i taget under Upptäck så att du kan betygsätta dem med stjärnor."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zeigt unbewertete Szenen oder Bilder einzeln unter Entdecken, damit du sie mit Sternen bewerten kannst."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser ikke-vurderte scener eller bilder ett om gangen under Utforsk, slik at du kan gi dem stjerner."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toont onbeoordeelde scènes of afbeeldingen een voor een onder Ontdek, zodat je ze met sterren kunt beoordelen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“发现”中逐个显示未评分的短片或图片，方便你用星级为其评分。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostra cenas ou imagens sem avaliação, uma de cada vez, em Descobrir, para você avaliá-las com estrelas."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「探索」中逐一顯示未評分的短片或圖片，讓你以星等評分。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未評価のシーンや画像を「見つける」で1つずつ表示し、星で評価できます。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يعرض المشاهد أو الصور غير المقيّمة واحدة تلو الأخرى ضمن «استكشاف»، لتقييمها بالنجوم."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Shows unrated scenes or images one at a time under Discover, so you can rate them with stars."}}}},"hint_shows_your_library_at_glance":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يعرض مكتبتك بنظرة سريعة في الأدوات: التشغيل وأعداد الكتالوج والتخزين."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Toont je bibliotheek in één oogopslag in Tools: afspelen, catalogusaantallen en opslag."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostra sua biblioteca num relance em Ferramentas: reprodução, contagens do catálogo e armazenamento."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser dit bibliotek på et øjeblik i Værktøjer: afspilning, katalogtal og lagerplads."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ライブラリの概要をツールに表示します：再生、カタログ件数、ストレージ。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中一览你的资料库：播放、目录数量和存储空间。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pokazuje w Narzędziach szybki przegląd biblioteki: odtwarzanie, liczby w katalogu i miejsce na dysku."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zeigt deine Bibliothek auf einen Blick in Werkzeuge: Wiedergabe, Katalogzahlen und Speicher."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Affiche votre bibliothèque en un coup d'œil dans Outils : lecture, nombres du catalogue et stockage."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viser biblioteket ditt med et blikk i Verktøy: avspilling, antall i katalogene og lagring."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Shows your library at a glance in Tools: playback, catalog counts and storage."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中一覽你的資料庫：播放、目錄數量和儲存空間。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Visar en snabböversikt över ditt bibliotek i Verktyg: uppspelning, antal i katalogen och lagring."}}}},"hint_sign_in_to_icloud_on":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inicie sessão no iCloud neste dispositivo para sincronizar."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"سجّل الدخول إلى iCloud على هذا الجهاز للمزامنة."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Logga in på iCloud på den här enheten för att synka."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Log ind på iCloud på denne enhed for at synkronisere."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"同期するには、このデバイスでiCloudにサインインしてください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Melde dich auf diesem Gerät bei iCloud an, um zu synchronisieren."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请在此设备上登录 iCloud 以进行同步。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請在此裝置上登入 iCloud 以進行同步。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zaloguj się do iCloud na tym urządzeniu, aby synchronizować."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sign in to iCloud on this device to sync."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Connectez-vous à iCloud sur cet appareil pour synchroniser."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Log in bij iCloud op dit apparaat om te synchroniseren."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Logg på iCloud på denne enheten for å synkronisere."}}}},"hint_slides_tab_bar_away_while":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schiebt die Tab-Leiste weg, während du in einer Liste nach unten scrollst, und holt sie beim Hochscrollen zurück. In Feeds (außer Pics) blendet sich die obere Leiste mit aus."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skjuler fanelinjen, mens du ruller ned i en liste, og viser den igen, når du ruller op. I Feeds (undtagen Pics) skjules den øverste bjælke sammen med den."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skyver fanelinjen bort når du ruller ned i en liste, og henter den tilbake når du ruller opp. I Feeds (unntatt Pics) skjules også topplinjen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"向下捲動列表時隱藏標籤列，向上捲動時再顯示。在 Feeds 中（Pics 除外），頂部列也會一起隱藏。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slides the tab bar away while you scroll down a list and brings it back when you scroll up. In Feeds (except Pics) the top bar hides with it."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يُخفي شريط علامات التبويب أثناء التمرير لأسفل في قائمة ويعيده عند التمرير لأعلى. في Feeds (باستثناء Pics) يختفي الشريط العلوي معه."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Masque la barre d'onglets lorsque vous faites défiler une liste vers le bas et la ramène lorsque vous remontez. Dans Feeds (sauf Pics), la barre du haut se masque aussi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Chowa pasek kart podczas przewijania listy w dół i przywraca go przy przewijaniu w górę. W Feeds (oprócz Pics) górny pasek chowa się razem z nim."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schuift de tabbalk weg als je in een lijst omlaag scrolt en brengt hem terug als je omhoog scrolt. In Feeds (behalve Pics) verdwijnt de bovenste balk mee."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"向下滚动列表时隐藏标签栏，向上滚动时重新显示。在 Feeds（Pics 除外）中，顶部栏也会随之隐藏。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"リストを下にスクロールするとタブバーを隠し、上にスクロールすると再表示します。Feeds（Picsを除く）では上部バーも一緒に隠れます。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Döljer flikfältet när du rullar nedåt i en lista och visar det igen när du rullar uppåt. I Feeds (utom Pics) döljs även det övre fältet."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Esconde a barra de abas enquanto você rola uma lista para baixo e a traz de volta ao rolar para cima. Em Feeds (exceto Pics), a barra superior se oculta junto."}}}},"hint_sort_order_each_section_opens":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A ordenação com que cada seção abre."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Sortierung, mit der jeder Bereich öffnet."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"每个版块打开时使用的排序方式。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sorteringen som varje sektion öppnas med."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"每個區段打開時使用的排序方式。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De sortering waarmee elk onderdeel opent."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'ordre de tri à l'ouverture de chaque section."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"各セクションを開いたときの並べ替え順です。"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ترتيب الفرز الذي يُفتح به كل قسم."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"The sort order each section opens with."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sorteringsrekkefølgen hver del åpnes med."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kolejność sortowania, z jaką otwiera się każda sekcja."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Den sortering, hver sektion åbner med."}}}},"hint_speech_model_download_failed_http":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speech model download failed (HTTP %@)"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"فشل تنزيل نموذج الكلام (HTTP %@)"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nedlasting av talemodell mislyktes (HTTP %@)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"音声モデルのダウンロードに失敗しました（HTTP %@）"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Échec du téléchargement du modèle vocal (HTTP %@)"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Falha ao baixar o modelo de fala (HTTP %@)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Laden des Sprachmodells fehlgeschlagen (HTTP %@)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kunde inte ladda ner talmodellen (HTTP %@)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"语音模型下载失败（HTTP %@）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"語音模型下載失敗（HTTP %@）"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Download af talemodel mislykkedes (HTTP %@)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pobieranie modelu mowy nie powiodło się (HTTP %@)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Download van spraakmodel mislukt (HTTP %@)"}}}},"hint_speech_recognition_is_not_allowed":{"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"التعرّف على الكلام غير مسموح به. فعّله من الإعدادات ← الخصوصية والأمن ← التعرّف على الكلام."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spraakherkenning is niet toegestaan. Schakel het in via Instellingen → Privacy en beveiliging → Spraakherkenning."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"La reconnaissance vocale n'est pas autorisée. Activez-la dans Réglages → Confidentialité et sécurité → Reconnaissance vocale."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Talegenkendelse er ikke tilladt. Slå det til under Indstillinger → Anonymitet & sikkerhed → Talegenkendelse."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Talegjenkjenning er ikke tillatt. Slå det på i Innstillinger → Personvern og sikkerhet → Talegjenkjenning."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O reconhecimento de fala não está permitido. Ative-o em Ajustes → Privacidade e Segurança → Reconhecimento de Fala."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"不允许语音识别。请在“设置”→“隐私与安全性”→“语音识别”中启用。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Taligenkänning är inte tillåten. Aktivera den i Inställningar → Integritet och säkerhet → Taligenkänning."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speech recognition is not allowed. Enable it in Settings → Privacy & Security → Speech Recognition."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"不允許語音辨識。請在「設定」→「隱私權與安全性」→「語音辨識」中啟用。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spracherkennung ist nicht erlaubt. Aktiviere sie unter Einstellungen → Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Spracherkennung."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rozpoznawanie mowy jest niedozwolone. Włącz je w Ustawienia → Prywatność i ochrona → Rozpoznawanie mowy."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"音声認識が許可されていません。設定 → プライバシーとセキュリティ → 音声認識で有効にしてください。"}}}},"hint_speech_recognition_is_not_available":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此设备上不支持该语言的语音识别。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O reconhecimento de fala não está disponível para este idioma neste dispositivo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spracherkennung ist für diese Sprache auf diesem Gerät nicht verfügbar."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"التعرّف على الكلام غير متاح لهذه اللغة على هذا الجهاز."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rozpoznawanie mowy nie jest dostępne dla tego języka na tym urządzeniu."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Talegjenkjenning er ikke tilgjengelig for dette språket på denne enheten."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spraakherkenning is op dit apparaat niet beschikbaar voor deze taal."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speech recognition is not available for this language on this device."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Talegenkendelse er ikke tilgængelig for dette sprog på denne enhed."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Taligenkänning är inte tillgänglig för det här språket på den här enheten."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"La reconnaissance vocale n'est pas disponible pour cette langue sur cet appareil."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このデバイスでは、この言語の音声認識を利用できません。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此裝置不支援此語言的語音辨識。"}}}},"hint_speech_recognition_is_not_available_on":{"localizations":{"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spraakherkenning is niet beschikbaar op dit apparaat."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Talegenkendelse er ikke tilgængelig på denne enhed."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Talegjenkjenning er ikke tilgjengelig på denne enheten."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speech recognition is not available on this device."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此裝置無法使用語音辨識。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此设备上不支持语音识别。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rozpoznawanie mowy nie jest dostępne na tym urządzeniu."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spracherkennung ist auf diesem Gerät nicht verfügbar."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Taligenkänning är inte tillgänglig på den här enheten."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"sta