on, nettbrett og Android TV med ett kjøp."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+は1回の購入で、スマートフォン、タブレット、Android TVのstashyのプレミアム機能をロック解除します。"}}}},"hint_stashy_plus_will_be_locked":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你再次输入密钥之前，stashy+ 将在此设备上保持锁定。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ bleibt auf diesem Gerät gesperrt, bis du den Schlüssel erneut eingibst."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ sera verrouillé sur cet appareil jusqu'à ce que vous saisissiez à nouveau la clé."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy+ ficará bloqueado neste dispositivo até você digitar a chave novamente."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låses på den här enheten tills du anger nyckeln igen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låses på denne enheten til du skriver inn nøkkelen igjen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ wordt op dit apparaat vergrendeld totdat je de sleutel opnieuw invoert."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ will be locked on this device until you enter the key again."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"キーを再度入力するまで、このデバイスのstashy+はロックされます。"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ låses på denne enhed, indtil du indtaster nøglen igen."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"سيُقفل stashy+ على هذا الجهاز حتى تُدخل المفتاح مجددًا."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy+ zostanie zablokowane na tym urządzeniu, dopóki ponownie nie wpiszesz klucza."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在你重新輸入金鑰之前，stashy+ 將在此裝置上鎖定。"}}}},"hint_stashy_uses_components_above_their":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy bruker komponentene ovenfor. Lisensene deres gjelder i tillegg til stashys egne vilkår."}},"zh-Hant":{"s